"""Cybersecurity glossary, part 5: application, cloud, operations, law and people."""

TERMS_5 = [
    ("owasp-top-10", "OWASP Top 10", ["owasp top 10", "owasp", "owasp top ten", "top 10 owasp", "owasp top dix", "owasp kumi bora", "owasp kumi vya juu"], "appsec", "software developers working at computers",
     {"fr": "OWASP Top 10 (dix risques majeurs des applications web)", "sw": "OWASP Top 10 (hatari kuu kumi za programu za wavuti)", "rw": "OWASP Top 10 (ibibazo 10 bikomeye by'umutekano wa porogaramu za interineti)"},
     "A well-known list, published by the non-profit OWASP community, of the most serious kinds of weakness found in web applications. It is updated from time to time and is meant as an awareness guide for developers.",
     "Developers and buyers of websites use it as a checklist when building or reviewing a web app. Schools and businesses can ask their web developer which of these risks have been checked.",
     "Une liste connue, publiée par la communauté à but non lucratif OWASP, des types de failles les plus graves dans les applications web. Elle est mise à jour de temps en temps et sert de guide de sensibilisation.",
     "Les développeurs et les acheteurs de sites web s'en servent comme liste de contrôle. Écoles et entreprises peuvent demander à leur développeur lesquels de ces risques ont été vérifiés.",
     "Ni urutonde rwemewe cyane rwakozwe n'umuryango OWASP udaharanira inyungu, rugaragaza ubwoko bw'intege nke zikomeye cyane mu porogaramu za interineti (web). Rujya ruvugururwa uko igihe gishize.",
     "Abakora porogaramu n'ababagurira za website barukoresha nk'urutonde rwo kugenzura. Amashuri n'ibigo bishobora kubaza ubikora ibyo byago byagenzuwe.",
     "Ni orodha maarufu, iliyochapishwa na jumuiya isiyo ya kibiashara ya OWASP, ya aina hatari zaidi za udhaifu katika programu za wavuti. Husasishwa mara kwa mara na hutumika kama mwongozo wa uelewa.",
     "Wasanidi programu na wanunuzi wa tovuti huitumia kama orodha ya ukaguzi. Shule na biashara zinaweza kumuuliza msanidi wao ni hatari zipi zimekaguliwa."),
    ("secure-coding", "Secure coding", ["secure coding", "secure programming", "safe coding", "codage sécurisé", "codage securise", "programmation sécurisée", "uandishi salama wa msimbo", "kwandika porogaramu itekanye"], "appsec", "programmer writing code on a laptop",
     {"fr": "Codage sécurisé", "sw": "Uandishi salama wa programu (secure coding)", "rw": "Kwandika porogaramu itekanye (secure coding)"},
     "Writing software in a way that avoids common mistakes that attackers can use, such as trusting user input, leaving passwords inside the code, or ignoring error handling.",
     "Teams follow coding guidelines, peer review and automatic checks. If you pay someone to build an app, ask how they keep it secure and who reviews the code before release.",
     "Écrire des logiciels en évitant les erreurs courantes que des attaquants peuvent exploiter, comme faire confiance aux saisies, laisser des mots de passe dans le code ou négliger la gestion des erreurs.",
     "Les équipes suivent des règles de codage, des relectures et des contrôles automatiques. Si vous payez quelqu'un pour créer une appli, demandez comment elle est sécurisée et qui relit le code.",
     "Ni ukwandika porogaramu wirinda amakosa asanzwe abagizi ba nabi bakoresha, nko kwizera ibyo umukoresha yinjije utabigenzuye, cyangwa gusiga amagambo y'ibanga mu nyandiko ya porogaramu.",
     "Amatsinda akurikiza amabwiriza yo kwandika, gusuzumana no kugenzura byikora. Niba wishyura umuntu kugukorera porogaramu, mubaze uko ayitekanisha n'uzasuzuma code mbere yo kuyisohora.",
     "Ni kuandika programu kwa njia inayoepuka makosa ya kawaida yanayoweza kutumiwa na washambuliaji, kama kuamini data ya mtumiaji, kuacha nenosiri ndani ya msimbo au kupuuza kushughulikia hitilafu.",
     "Timu hufuata miongozo ya uandishi, ukaguzi wa wenzao na ukaguzi wa kiotomatiki. Ukilipa mtu kujenga programu, muulize anavyoilinda na nani hukagua msimbo kabla ya kutoa."),
    ("input-validation", "Input validation", ["input validation", "validate input", "sanitize input", "input sanitization", "validation des entrées", "validation des entrees", "uthibitishaji wa data ingizo", "kugenzura ibyinjijwe"], "appsec", "person typing on a keyboard",
     {"fr": "Validation des entrées", "sw": "Uthibitishaji wa data ingizo (input validation)", "rw": "Kugenzura amakuru yinjijwe (input validation)"},
     "Checking that anything a user or another system sends to a program, such as a form field, file or web address, has the expected type, length and format before the program uses it.",
     "It is a basic defence against many attacks on websites and apps. Developers should check input on the server, not only in the browser, and reject or clean unexpected data.",
     "Vérifier que tout ce qu'un utilisateur ou un autre système envoie à un programme (champ de formulaire, fichier, adresse web) a le type, la longueur et le format attendus avant son utilisation.",
     "C'est une défense de base contre de nombreuses attaques. Les développeurs doivent contrôler côté serveur, pas seulement dans le navigateur, et rejeter ou nettoyer les données inattendues.",
     "Ni ukugenzura ko ibyo umukoresha cyangwa indi sisitemu yohereza muri porogaramu, nk'ikibanza cy'ifishi, dosiye cyangwa aderesi, bifite ubwoko, uburebure n'imiterere byitezwe mbere yo kubikoresha.",
     "Ni uburyo bw'ibanze bwo kwirinda ibitero byinshi ku mbuga na porogaramu. Abakora porogaramu bagomba kugenzura kuri seriveri, atari muri browser gusa, bakanga cyangwa bagasukura amakuru adasanzwe.",
     "Ni kukagua kwamba chochote mtumiaji au mfumo mwingine hutuma kwa programu, kama sehemu ya fomu, faili au anwani ya wavuti, kina aina, urefu na muundo unaotarajiwa kabla ya kutumika.",
     "Ni ulinzi wa msingi dhidi ya mashambulizi mengi. Wasanidi wanapaswa kukagua kwenye seva, si kivinjari pekee, na kukataa au kusafisha data isiyotarajiwa."),
    ("api-security", "API security", ["api security", "api", "securing apis", "sécurité des api", "securite des api", "usalama wa api", "umutekano wa api", "web api security"], "appsec", "web server rack with cables",
     {"fr": "Sécurité des API", "sw": "Usalama wa API", "rw": "Umutekano wa API"},
     "Protecting APIs, the doorways that let apps and services exchange data, so that only permitted users and programs can call them and each can see only its own data.",
     "Mobile apps, payment services and websites rely on APIs. Organisations should require authentication, limit what each caller may do, restrict request rates and log use. Never publish API keys in public code.",
     "Protéger les API, ces portes qui permettent aux applications et services d'échanger des données, afin que seuls les utilisateurs et programmes autorisés les appellent et ne voient que leurs propres données.",
     "Applis mobiles, paiements et sites s'appuient sur des API. Exigez une authentification, limitez ce que chaque appelant peut faire, plafonnez les requêtes et journalisez. Ne publiez jamais de clés d'API dans du code public.",
     "Ni ukurinda API, ni zo nzira zituma porogaramu na serivisi zihana amakuru, kugira ngo abemerewe gusa ni bo bazikoresha kandi buri wese abone amakuru ye gusa.",
     "Porogaramu za telefone, kwishyura n'imbuga bishingiye kuri API. Ibigo bigomba gusaba kwemeza uwo ari we, kugabanya ibyo buri ukoresha yemerewe, no kubika ibyakozwe. Ntukigere ushyira API keys mu code igaragara ku mugaragaro.",
     "Ni kulinda API, milango inayoruhusu programu na huduma kubadilishana data, ili watumiaji na programu walioruhusiwa pekee waweze kuzitumia na kila mmoja aone data yake tu.",
     "Programu za simu, malipo na tovuti hutegemea API. Mashirika yanapaswa kudai uthibitisho wa utambulisho, kupunguza kile kila mtumiaji anaweza kufanya na kuweka kumbukumbu. Usichapishe funguo za API kwenye msimbo wa umma."),
    ("command-injection", "Command injection", ["command injection", "os command injection", "shell injection", "injection de commande", "injection de commandes", "uingizaji wa amri", "command injection attack"], "appsec", "computer terminal screen with text",
     {"fr": "Injection de commandes", "sw": "Command injection (uingizaji wa amri)", "rw": "Command injection (gushyira amabwiriza mu porogaramu)"},
     "A weakness where a program passes user-supplied text to the computer's command line without proper checks, so an attacker can make the server run commands the developer never intended.",
     "It affects badly written web tools and admin pages. Developers should avoid calling system commands with user input and validate strictly; administrators should keep software patched and run services with minimal rights.",
     "Une faille où un programme transmet du texte fourni par l'utilisateur à la ligne de commande sans contrôle, permettant à un attaquant de faire exécuter au serveur des commandes non prévues.",
     "Elle touche des outils web mal écrits. Les développeurs doivent éviter d'appeler des commandes système avec des données saisies et valider strictement ; les administrateurs maintiennent les logiciels à jour avec des droits minimaux.",
     "Ni intege nke aho porogaramu yoherereza komanda ya mudasobwa ibyo umukoresha yanditse nta kubigenzura, bigatuma umugizi wa nabi atuma seriveri ikora amabwiriza uwayikoze atigeze ateganya.",
     "Ibangamira porogaramu zakozwe nabi. Abazikora bagomba kwirinda guhamagara komanda za sisitemu bakoresheje ibyinjijwe, kandi bakagenzura cyane; abayobora sisitemu bagakomeza kuvugurura no guha serivisi uburenganzira buto gusa.",
     "Ni udhaifu ambapo programu hupitisha maandishi ya mtumiaji kwenye mstari wa amri wa kompyuta bila ukaguzi, na mshambuliaji anaweza kuifanya seva iendeshe amri ambazo msanidi hakukusudia.",
     "Huathiri zana za wavuti zilizoandikwa vibaya. Wasanidi waepuke kuita amri za mfumo kwa data ya mtumiaji na wakague kikamilifu; wasimamizi wasasishe programu na kutoa ruhusa ndogo kabisa."),
    ("path-traversal", "Path traversal", ["path traversal", "directory traversal", "dot dot slash", "traversée de répertoire", "traversee de repertoire", "parcours de chemin", "kupita kwenye saraka", "path traversal attack"], "appsec", "filing cabinet drawers",
     {"fr": "Traversée de répertoires", "sw": "Path traversal (kupenya saraka zisizoruhusiwa)", "rw": "Path traversal (kugera kuri dosiye zitemewe)"},
     "A weakness where a program lets a user name a file path and fails to stop them from reaching files outside the intended folder, such as configuration files or other people's documents.",
     "It appears in download pages and file viewers. Developers should only serve files from a fixed list or folder, check paths strictly, and keep sensitive files away from the web server's folders.",
     "Une faille où un programme laisse l'utilisateur indiquer un chemin de fichier sans l'empêcher d'atteindre des fichiers hors du dossier prévu, comme des fichiers de configuration ou des documents d'autrui.",
     "On la trouve dans des pages de téléchargement ou visionneuses de fichiers. Les développeurs ne servent que des fichiers d'une liste ou d'un dossier fixe, vérifient strictement les chemins et isolent les fichiers sensibles.",
     "Ni intege nke aho porogaramu yemerera umukoresha kwandika inzira ya dosiye ariko ntimubuze kugera ku madosiye atari mu bubiko bwateganyijwe, nk'amadosiye y'imikorere cyangwa inyandiko z'abandi.",
     "Iboneka ku mapaji yo gukuramo no kureba dosiye. Abakora porogaramu bagomba gutanga dosiye zo mu rutonde cyangwa ububiko bumwe gusa, bakagenzura inzira, kandi bagashyira dosiye z'ibanga kure ya seriveri y'urubuga.",
     "Ni udhaifu ambapo programu humruhusu mtumiaji kutaja njia ya faili bila kumzuia kufikia faili nje ya folda iliyokusudiwa, kama faili za usanidi au nyaraka za wengine.",
     "Hupatikana kwenye kurasa za kupakua na vionyeshi vya faili. Wasanidi watoe faili kutoka orodha au folda maalum tu, wakague njia kikamilifu na waweke faili nyeti mbali na folda za seva ya wavuti."),
    ("server-side-request-forgery", "Server-side request forgery (SSRF)", ["ssrf", "server side request forgery", "server-side request forgery", "falsification de requête côté serveur", "falsification de requete cote serveur", "ughushi wa ombi upande wa seva", "ssrf attack"], "appsec", "server room with racks",
     {"fr": "Falsification de requête côté serveur (SSRF)", "sw": "SSRF (ughushi wa ombi upande wa seva)", "rw": "SSRF (gutuma seriveri gusaba amakuru itagombaga)"},
     "A weakness where an attacker tricks a server into sending requests to places chosen by the attacker, often internal systems or cloud services that the attacker cannot reach directly.",
     "It affects features that fetch a web address for the user, such as link previews or image import. Developers should allow only approved destinations; organisations should limit what servers can reach internally.",
     "Une faille où un attaquant pousse un serveur à envoyer des requêtes vers des destinations choisies par lui, souvent des systèmes internes ou services cloud qu'il ne peut pas atteindre directement.",
     "Elle touche les fonctions qui récupèrent une adresse web pour l'utilisateur (aperçus de liens, import d'images). Autorisez seulement des destinations approuvées et limitez ce que les serveurs peuvent joindre en interne.",
     "Ni intege nke aho umugizi wa nabi ayobya seriveri ikohereza ubusabe aho we ashaka, akenshi kuri sisitemu z'imbere cyangwa serivisi za cloud atagera ku buryo bweruye.",
     "Ibangamira ibikorwa bifata aderesi y'urubuga ku bw'umukoresha, nko kureba ibimenyetso by'amaliki cyangwa kwinjiza amafoto. Abakora porogaramu bemera aho bigomba kujya gusa; ibigo bikagabanya aho seriveri zigera.",
     "Ni udhaifu ambapo mshambuliaji hudanganya seva itume maombi kwa maeneo anayochagua, mara nyingi mifumo ya ndani au huduma za cloud ambazo hawezi kuzifikia moja kwa moja.",
     "Huathiri kipengele kinachopakua anwani ya wavuti kwa mtumiaji, kama hakikisho la viungo au kuleta picha. Wasanidi waruhusu maeneo yaliyoidhinishwa tu; mashirika yapunguze seva zinakoweza kufikia ndani."),
    ("insecure-deserialization", "Insecure deserialization", ["insecure deserialization", "unsafe deserialization", "deserialization", "désérialisation non sécurisée", "deserialisation non securisee", "deserialization isiyo salama", "deserialization itizewe"], "appsec", "software engineer reviewing code",
     {"fr": "Désérialisation non sécurisée", "sw": "Insecure deserialization (urejeshaji data usio salama)", "rw": "Insecure deserialization (gusoma amakuru adatekanye)"},
     "A weakness where a program rebuilds objects from data it received without checking that data, so a crafted package can change the program's behaviour or even run harmful code.",
     "It affects apps that accept saved objects, cookies or messages from users. Developers should avoid rebuilding objects from untrusted data, prefer simple formats and verify integrity with a signature.",
     "Une faille où un programme reconstruit des objets à partir de données reçues sans les vérifier, si bien qu'un paquet fabriqué peut modifier son comportement ou exécuter du code nuisible.",
     "Elle touche les applis qui acceptent des objets enregistrés, cookies ou messages d'utilisateurs. Évitez de reconstruire des objets depuis des données non fiables, préférez des formats simples et vérifiez l'intégrité par signature.",
     "Ni intege nke aho porogaramu isubiza mu gihe amakuru yabonye itabanje kuyagenzura, bigatuma ipaki yakozwe n'umugizi wa nabi ihindura imikorere yayo cyangwa ikayikoresha code mbi.",
     "Ibangamira porogaramu zakira amakuru yabitswe, cookies cyangwa ubutumwa bw'abakoresha. Abazikora birinda gusubiza amakuru atizewe, bagakoresha imiterere yoroshye kandi bagakoresha umukono wo kwemeza ko atahindutse.",
     "Ni udhaifu ambapo programu huunda upya vitu kutoka kwa data iliyopokelewa bila kuikagua, hivyo kifurushi kilichotengenezwa kinaweza kubadilisha tabia ya programu au kuendesha msimbo hatari.",
     "Huathiri programu zinazokubali vitu vilivyohifadhiwa, vidakuzi au ujumbe kutoka kwa watumiaji. Wasanidi waepuke kuunda upya kutoka data isiyoaminika, watumie muundo rahisi na wathibitishe uadilifu kwa saini."),
    ("security-misconfiguration", "Security misconfiguration", ["security misconfiguration", "misconfiguration", "misconfigured", "default settings", "mauvaise configuration", "erreur de configuration", "usanidi mbaya", "imiterere mibi"], "appsec", "network cables plugged into a switch",
     {"fr": "Mauvaise configuration de sécurité", "sw": "Usanidi mbaya wa usalama (misconfiguration)", "rw": "Imiterere mibi y'umutekano (misconfiguration)"},
     "A weakness caused by settings that are wrong or left at their defaults, such as default passwords, open storage, unneeded services switched on or detailed error messages shown to everyone.",
     "It is one of the most common causes of breaches. Change default passwords, switch off what you do not use, check cloud storage is private, and review settings after every change or installation.",
     "Une faiblesse due à des réglages erronés ou laissés par défaut : mots de passe d'origine, stockage ouvert, services inutiles activés ou messages d'erreur détaillés visibles par tous.",
     "C'est l'une des causes les plus fréquentes de fuites. Changez les mots de passe par défaut, désactivez ce qui est inutile, vérifiez que le stockage cloud est privé et revoyez les réglages après chaque changement.",
     "Ni intege nke ziterwa n'imiterere itari yo cyangwa yasizwe uko yaje, nk'amagambo y'ibanga y'ibanze, ububiko bufunguye, serivisi zidakenewe zifunguye cyangwa ubutumwa burambuye bw'amakosa buboneka kuri bose.",
     "Ni imwe mu mpamvu zikunze gutera kumeneka kw'amakuru. Hindura amagambo y'ibanga y'ibanze, zimya ibyo udakoresha, genzura ko ububiko bwa cloud ari ubwite, kandi usuzume imiterere nyuma ya buri mpinduka.",
     "Ni udhaifu unaosababishwa na mipangilio isiyo sahihi au iliyoachwa kama ilivyo, kama nenosiri la awali, hifadhi iliyo wazi, huduma zisizohitajika zilizowashwa au ujumbe wa kina wa hitilafu unaoonekana kwa wote.",
     "Ni mojawapo ya sababu za kawaida za uvujaji. Badilisha nenosiri la awali, zima usichokitumia, hakikisha hifadhi ya cloud ni ya faragha na kagua mipangilio baada ya kila mabadiliko."),
    ("vulnerability-scanning", "Vulnerability scanning", ["vulnerability scanning", "vulnerability scan", "vulnerability scanner", "vuln scan", "scan de vulnérabilités", "analyse de vulnérabilités", "uchanganuzi wa udhaifu", "gusuzuma intege nke"], "operations", "technician checking network equipment",
     {"fr": "Analyse de vulnérabilités", "sw": "Uchanganuzi wa udhaifu (vulnerability scanning)", "rw": "Gusuzuma intege nke (vulnerability scanning)"},
     "Using an automated tool to check computers, networks or apps for known weaknesses such as missing updates or unsafe settings, and to produce a list of findings to fix.",
     "Organisations run scans regularly and after changes, then fix the most serious findings first. Only scan systems you own or have written permission to test; scanning others' systems may be illegal.",
     "Utiliser un outil automatique pour vérifier ordinateurs, réseaux ou applis à la recherche de faiblesses connues, comme des mises à jour manquantes ou des réglages dangereux, et produire une liste à corriger.",
     "Les organisations scannent régulièrement et après chaque changement, puis corrigent d'abord les points graves. Ne scannez que vos propres systèmes ou ceux pour lesquels vous avez une autorisation écrite ; sinon cela peut être illégal.",
     "Ni ugukoresha igikoresho cyikora gusuzuma mudasobwa, imiyoboro cyangwa porogaramu hashakishwa intege nke zizwi, nko kuvugurura kutakozwe cyangwa imiterere itekanye nabi, hagakorwa urutonde rwo gukosora.",
     "Ibigo bibikora buri gihe no nyuma y'impinduka, bigakosora izikomeye mbere. Suzuma gusa sisitemu ni izawe cyangwa ufitiye uruhushya rwanditse; gusuzuma iz'abandi bishobora kuba binyuranyije n'amategeko.",
     "Ni kutumia zana ya kiotomatiki kukagua kompyuta, mitandao au programu kutafuta udhaifu unaojulikana, kama masasisho yaliyokosekana au mipangilio hatari, na kutoa orodha ya kurekebisha.",
     "Mashirika hufanya hivyo mara kwa mara na baada ya mabadiliko, kisha hurekebisha makubwa kwanza. Changanua mifumo yako au uliyoruhusiwa kwa maandishi tu; kuchanganua ya wengine kunaweza kuwa kinyume cha sheria."),
    ("penetration-testing", "Penetration testing (pentest)", ["penetration testing", "pentest", "pen test", "pentesting", "penetration test", "test d'intrusion", "tests d'intrusion", "jaribio la kupenya", "ikizamini cyo kwinjira muri sisitemu"], "operations", "security professional at a computer in an office",
     {"fr": "Test d'intrusion (pentest)", "sw": "Penetration testing (jaribio la kupenya mfumo kwa idhini)", "rw": "Penetration testing (igerageza ryemewe ryo gusuzuma umutekano)"},
     "An authorised, agreed-in-writing exercise in which skilled testers try to find and prove weaknesses in a system, then report them so the owner can fix them.",
     "Banks, telecoms and government bodies hire testers before launching or after major changes. Always agree the scope and permission in a contract; testing a system without authorisation is a crime.",
     "Exercice autorisé et convenu par écrit où des testeurs qualifiés cherchent et démontrent des faiblesses d'un système, puis les rapportent au propriétaire pour correction.",
     "Banques, opérateurs et administrations y recourent avant un lancement ou après de gros changements. Définissez toujours le périmètre et l'autorisation dans un contrat ; tester sans autorisation est un délit.",
     "Ni igerageza ryemewe ryanditsweho aho abahanga bashaka kandi bakagaragaza intege nke z'ikoranabuhanga, hanyuma bakazimenyesha nyirayo kugira ngo azikosore.",
     "Banki, ibigo by'itumanaho na leta babikoresha mbere yo gutangira cyangwa nyuma y'impinduka nini. Burigihe semeranya ku bikorwa n'uruhushya mu masezerano; gukora igerageza nta ruhushya ni icyaha.",
     "Ni zoezi lililoidhinishwa na kukubaliwa kwa maandishi ambapo wataalamu hutafuta na kuthibitisha udhaifu wa mfumo, kisha kuripoti kwa mmiliki auboreshe.",
     "Benki, kampuni za mawasiliano na serikali huajiri wataalamu kabla ya uzinduzi au baada ya mabadiliko makubwa. Kubaliana wigo na ruhusa kwenye mkataba; kujaribu mfumo bila idhini ni kosa la jinai."),
    ("red-team", "Red team", ["red team", "red teaming", "red team exercise", "équipe rouge", "equipe rouge", "red team security", "timu nyekundu", "itsinda ritukura"], "people", "team of professionals planning around a table",
     {"fr": "Red team (équipe rouge)", "sw": "Red team (timu inayojaribu kushambulia kwa idhini)", "rw": "Red team (itsinda ryemewe ryigana ibitero)"},
     "A group authorised by an organisation to act like a realistic attacker, within agreed limits, to test how well its people, processes and technology detect and resist an attack.",
     "Larger organisations use red teams to test their defences without harm. The work is done only under written authorisation and rules of engagement, and the findings are shared to improve protection.",
     "Groupe autorisé par une organisation à se comporter comme un attaquant réaliste, dans des limites convenues, pour tester la capacité de ses équipes, processus et technologies à détecter et résister à une attaque.",
     "Les grandes organisations y recourent pour tester leurs défenses sans dégâts. Le travail se fait sous autorisation écrite et règles d'engagement, et les résultats servent à renforcer la protection.",
     "Ni itsinda ryemerewe n'ikigo kwigana umugizi wa nabi nyawe, mu mipaka yumvikanyweho, kugira ngo harebwe ko abakozi, uburyo bw'imikorere n'ikoranabuhanga bishobora kubona no guhangana n'igitero.",
     "Ibigo binini birikoresha mu gupima uburinzi bwabyo nta kwangiza. Akazi gakorwa gusa bafite uruhushya rwanditse n'amategeko y'ibikorwa, ibyavuye mu bipimo bigakoreshwa kunoza umutekano.",
     "Ni kikundi kilichoidhinishwa na shirika kutenda kama mshambuliaji halisi, ndani ya mipaka iliyokubaliwa, kupima uwezo wa watu, michakato na teknolojia kugundua na kupinga shambulio.",
     "Mashirika makubwa huitumia kupima ulinzi wao bila madhara. Kazi hufanywa kwa idhini ya maandishi na kanuni za ushiriki, na matokeo hutumika kuboresha ulinzi."),
    ("blue-team", "Blue team", ["blue team", "blue teaming", "défenseurs", "équipe bleue", "equipe bleue", "timu ya bluu", "itsinda ry'ubururu", "defenders team"], "people", "security operations center monitors",
     {"fr": "Blue team (équipe bleue)", "sw": "Blue team (timu ya ulinzi)", "rw": "Blue team (itsinda rishinzwe kurinda)"},
     "The people responsible for defending an organisation day to day: monitoring systems, detecting suspicious activity, responding to incidents and strengthening protections.",
     "In a small school or business this may be one IT person; in a bank it is a full security team. Good defenders keep updates, backups and monitoring in place and learn from tests by red teams.",
     "Les personnes chargées de défendre une organisation au quotidien : surveiller les systèmes, détecter les activités suspectes, répondre aux incidents et renforcer les protections.",
     "Dans une petite école ou entreprise, ce peut être un seul informaticien ; dans une banque, une équipe complète. Les bons défenseurs maintiennent mises à jour, sauvegardes et surveillance, et apprennent des tests des red teams.",
     "Ni abantu bashinzwe kurinda ikigo buri munsi: gukurikirana sisitemu, kubona ibikorwa bikemangwa, gusubiza ibitero no gukomeza uburinzi.",
     "Mu ishuri cyangwa ubucuruzi buto bishobora kuba umuntu umwe w'ikoranabuhanga; muri banki ni itsinda ryuzuye. Abarinzi beza bakomeza kuvugurura, kubika kopi no gukurikirana, kandi bakigira ku bipimo bya red team.",
     "Ni watu wanaohusika kulinda shirika kila siku: kufuatilia mifumo, kugundua shughuli za kutia shaka, kukabili matukio na kuimarisha ulinzi.",
     "Katika shule au biashara ndogo inaweza kuwa mtu mmoja wa TEHAMA; benki ina timu kamili. Walinzi wazuri hudumisha masasisho, nakala rudufu na ufuatiliaji, na hujifunza kutokana na majaribio ya red team."),
    ("purple-team", "Purple team", ["purple team", "purple teaming", "équipe violette", "equipe violette", "timu ya zambarau", "itsinda rya purple", "red and blue collaboration"], "people", "colleagues collaborating at a meeting table",
     {"fr": "Purple team (équipe violette)", "sw": "Purple team (ushirikiano wa red na blue team)", "rw": "Purple team (imikoranire ya red na blue team)"},
     "A way of working in which the attack-simulating red team and the defending blue team share what they learn in real time, so defences improve faster than if each worked apart.",
     "It is mostly used by organisations with both functions. The idea can also help smaller teams: whoever tests a system and whoever runs it should sit together and fix the findings.",
     "Une façon de travailler où la red team, qui simule des attaques, et la blue team, qui défend, partagent leurs découvertes en temps réel pour améliorer les défenses plus vite que séparément.",
     "Elle est surtout utilisée par les organisations ayant les deux fonctions. L'idée vaut aussi pour de petites équipes : ceux qui testent un système et ceux qui l'exploitent doivent se parler et corriger ensemble.",
     "Ni uburyo bw'akazi aho red team yigana ibitero na blue team irinda basangira ibyo bavumbuye ako kanya, bigatuma uburinzi bumera neza vuba kurusha igihe buri tsinda rikora ukwaryo.",
     "Bukoreshwa cyane n'ibigo bifite ayo mahuriro yombi. Igitekerezo gishobora no gufasha amatsinda mato: ukora igerageza n'ukoresha sisitemu bagomba guhurira hamwe bagakosora ibyabonetse.",
     "Ni njia ya kufanya kazi ambapo red team inayoiga mashambulizi na blue team inayolinda hushiriki wanachojifunza papo hapo, ili ulinzi uimarike haraka kuliko kila mmoja akifanya kazi peke yake.",
     "Hutumiwa zaidi na mashirika yenye majukumu yote mawili. Wazo hili linaweza kusaidia timu ndogo pia: anayejaribu mfumo na anayeuendesha wakae pamoja na kurekebisha matokeo."),
    ("bug-bounty", "Bug bounty", ["bug bounty", "bug bounty program", "vulnerability reward", "responsible disclosure", "prime aux bugs", "programme de bug bounty", "zawadi ya kugundua hitilafu", "igihembo cyo kubona intege nke"], "people", "people at a technology conference",
     {"fr": "Bug bounty (prime aux failles)", "sw": "Bug bounty (zawadi ya kuripoti udhaifu)", "rw": "Bug bounty (igihembo cyo kumenyesha intege nke)"},
     "A programme where an organisation invites outside researchers to report security weaknesses they find, following published rules, and rewards valid reports with money or recognition.",
     "If you find a weakness, report it through the organisation's official channel and do not exploit it, download data or tell the public first. Organisations should publish clear rules and a contact point.",
     "Programme par lequel une organisation invite des chercheurs externes à signaler les failles qu'ils trouvent, selon des règles publiées, et récompense les signalements valides par de l'argent ou une reconnaissance.",
     "Si vous trouvez une faille, signalez-la par le canal officiel, sans l'exploiter, sans télécharger de données et sans la publier d'abord. Les organisations doivent publier des règles claires et un contact.",
     "Ni gahunda aho ikigo gitumira abashakashatsi bo hanze kumenyesha intege nke babonye, bakurikije amategeko yatangajwe, maze raporo zemewe zigahembwa amafaranga cyangwa zigashimirwa.",
     "Nubona intege nke, uzimenyeshe ku buryo bwemewe bw'ikigo, ntuzikoreshe, ntukuremo amakuru kandi ntuzibwire rubanda mbere. Ibigo bigomba gutangaza amategeko asobanutse n'aho kubariza.",
     "Ni mpango ambapo shirika huwaalika watafiti wa nje kuripoti udhaifu wanaoupata, kwa kufuata sheria zilizochapishwa, na kulipa ripoti halali kwa fedha au sifa.",
     "Ukigundua udhaifu, uripoti kupitia njia rasmi ya shirika; usiutumie, usipakue data wala kuwaambia umma kwanza. Mashirika yachapishe sheria wazi na mahali pa mawasiliano."),
    ("ethical-hacking", "Ethical hacking", ["ethical hacking", "ethical hacker", "legal hacking", "piratage éthique", "hacking éthique", "hacker éthique", "udukuzi wa kimaadili", "gutera ibitero byemewe"], "people", "students in a computer lab",
     {"fr": "Hacking éthique (piratage éthique)", "sw": "Ethical hacking (udukuzi wa kimaadili)", "rw": "Ethical hacking (gusuzuma umutekano mu buryo bwemewe)"},
     "Testing computer systems for weaknesses with the owner's permission, in order to help protect them. What makes it ethical is authorisation, honesty about findings and care not to cause harm.",
     "It is a recognised career and training path. Practise only on your own equipment, training labs or systems where you have written permission; the same actions without permission can be a crime.",
     "Tester des systèmes informatiques pour y trouver des faiblesses, avec l'accord de leur propriétaire, afin de mieux les protéger. Ce qui le rend éthique : l'autorisation, l'honnêteté sur les résultats et l'absence de dégâts.",
     "C'est un métier et une filière de formation reconnus. Exercez-vous seulement sur votre propre matériel, des laboratoires d'entraînement ou des systèmes autorisés par écrit ; sans permission, les mêmes actes peuvent être un délit.",
     "Ni ugusuzuma sisitemu za mudasobwa ushaka intege nke ufite uruhushya rwa nyirazo, hagamijwe kuzirinda. Ikizigira iy'ubunyangamugayo ni uruhushya, kuvugisha ukuri ku byabonetse no kutangiza.",
     "Ni umwuga no kwiga bizwi. Itoze ku bikoresho byawe, mu ma laboratwari yo kwigiramo cyangwa kuri sisitemu ufitiye uruhushya rwanditse; ibyo bikorwa nta ruhushya bishobora kuba icyaha.",
     "Ni kujaribu mifumo ya kompyuta kutafuta udhaifu kwa ruhusa ya mmiliki, ili kusaidia kuilinda. Kinachoufanya kuwa wa kimaadili ni idhini, uaminifu kuhusu matokeo na kutosababisha madhara.",
     "Ni taaluma na njia ya mafunzo inayotambulika. Fanya mazoezi kwenye vifaa vyako, maabara za mafunzo au mifumo uliyoruhusiwa kwa maandishi; vitendo hivyo bila ruhusa vinaweza kuwa kosa la jinai."),
    ("white-hat-hacker", "White hat hacker", ["white hat hacker", "white hat", "white-hat", "hacker au chapeau blanc", "chapeau blanc", "mdukuzi kofia nyeupe", "umuhanga w'umutekano wemewe", "ethical hacker role"], "people", "cybersecurity professional at desk",
     {"fr": "Hacker chapeau blanc", "sw": "White hat hacker (mdukuzi wa kimaadili)", "rw": "White hat hacker (umuhanga ukora ku mugaragaro ku bw'umutekano)"},
     "A security expert who looks for weaknesses with permission and reports them so they can be fixed. The name comes from the 'good guy' hat in old films and is a label, not a legal status.",
     "White hat hackers work as employees, consultants or authorised researchers. When hiring one, check their references, agree the scope in a contract and ask for a clear written report.",
     "Expert en sécurité qui cherche des failles avec autorisation et les signale pour qu'elles soient corrigées. Le nom vient du chapeau du « gentil » dans les vieux films ; c'est une étiquette, pas un statut légal.",
     "Les hackers chapeau blanc sont salariés, consultants ou chercheurs autorisés. Pour en engager un, vérifiez ses références, fixez le périmètre par contrat et demandez un rapport écrit clair.",
     "Ni impuguke mu mutekano ishakisha intege nke ifite uruhushya ikazimenyesha kugira ngo zikosorwe. Izina rituruka ku ngofero y'umwiza muri filime za kera; ni ikirango, si icyemezo cy'amategeko.",
     "Abakora uyu mwuga ni abakozi, abajyanama cyangwa abashakashatsi bemerewe. Iyo ugiye kumwakira, genzura abamuzi, musezerane ibikorwa mu masezerano kandi usabe raporo yanditse isobanutse.",
     "Ni mtaalamu wa usalama anayetafuta udhaifu kwa ruhusa na kuuripoti ili urekebishwe. Jina linatoka kwa kofia ya 'mtu mwema' kwenye filamu za zamani; ni lebo, si hadhi ya kisheria.",
     "Hufanya kazi kama waajiriwa, washauri au watafiti walioidhinishwa. Ukimwajiri, kagua marejeo yake, kubaliana wigo kwenye mkataba na uombe ripoti ya maandishi iliyo wazi."),
    ("black-hat-hacker", "Black hat hacker", ["black hat hacker", "black hat", "black-hat", "malicious hacker", "hacker au chapeau noir", "chapeau noir", "mdukuzi kofia nyeusi", "umugizi wa nabi w'ikoranabuhanga"], "people", "hooded figure silhouette at keyboard",
     {"fr": "Hacker chapeau noir", "sw": "Black hat hacker (mdukuzi mhalifu)", "rw": "Black hat hacker (umugizi wa nabi winjira muri sisitemu)"},
     "A person who breaks into systems without permission for personal gain or to cause harm, for example to steal money or data. Such acts are crimes in most countries, including Rwanda.",
     "Their targets are ordinary people and organisations alike. Defend yourself with strong unique passwords, two-step verification, updates and backups, and report incidents to your IT team or the authorities.",
     "Personne qui s'introduit sans autorisation dans des systèmes pour un gain personnel ou pour nuire, par exemple voler de l'argent ou des données. Ces actes sont des délits dans la plupart des pays, dont le Rwanda.",
     "Leurs cibles sont autant les particuliers que les organisations. Protégez-vous avec des mots de passe solides et uniques, la vérification en deux étapes, les mises à jour et sauvegardes, et signalez les incidents.",
     "Ni umuntu winjira muri sisitemu nta ruhushya agamije inyungu ze cyangwa kugira nabi, nko kwiba amafaranga cyangwa amakuru. Ibyo bikorwa ni ibyaha mu bihugu byinshi, harimo n'u Rwanda.",
     "Abo bibasira ni abantu basanzwe n'ibigo. Ikingire ukoresheje amagambo y'ibanga akomeye kandi atandukanye, kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri, kuvugurura no kubika kopi, kandi umenyeshe ababishinzwe ibyabaye.",
     "Ni mtu anayevamia mifumo bila ruhusa kwa faida binafsi au kudhuru, kwa mfano kuiba pesa au data. Vitendo hivyo ni makosa ya jinai katika nchi nyingi, ikiwemo Rwanda.",
     "Walengwa wao ni watu wa kawaida na mashirika. Jilinde kwa nenosiri imara tofauti, uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili, masasisho na nakala rudufu, na ripoti matukio kwa timu ya TEHAMA au mamlaka."),
    ("grey-hat-hacker", "Grey hat hacker", ["grey hat hacker", "gray hat hacker", "grey hat", "gray hat", "hacker au chapeau gris", "chapeau gris", "mdukuzi kofia ya kijivu", "umuhanga uri hagati"], "people", "person using a laptop at night",
     {"fr": "Hacker chapeau gris", "sw": "Grey hat hacker (mdukuzi wa kati)", "rw": "Grey hat hacker (umuhanga uri hagati y'ubwiza n'ububi)"},
     "A person who looks for weaknesses in systems without being asked, and often tells the owner afterwards. They may mean well, but acting without permission can still break the law.",
     "If you find a weakness by accident, stop, do not explore further or copy data, and report it to the owner or the authorities. Organisations should offer a simple, safe way to receive such reports.",
     "Personne qui cherche des failles dans des systèmes sans y avoir été invitée et en informe souvent ensuite le propriétaire. Elle peut avoir de bonnes intentions, mais agir sans autorisation peut rester illégal.",
     "Si vous découvrez une faille par hasard, arrêtez, n'explorez pas davantage, ne copiez aucune donnée et signalez-la au propriétaire ou aux autorités. Les organisations devraient offrir un moyen simple et sûr de recevoir ces signalements.",
     "Ni umuntu ushakisha intege nke muri sisitemu nta wabimusabye, kenshi akabimenyesha nyirazo nyuma. Ashobora kuba afite umutima mwiza, ariko gukora nta ruhushya bishobora kuba binyuranyije n'amategeko.",
     "Nubona intege nke ku bw'impanuka, hagarara, ntukomeze gushakisha, ntukope amakuru kandi ubimenyeshe nyirayo cyangwa ubuyobozi. Ibigo bigomba gutanga uburyo bworoshye kandi butekanye bwo kwakira izo raporo.",
     "Ni mtu anayetafuta udhaifu kwenye mifumo bila kuombwa, na mara nyingi humjulisha mmiliki baadaye. Anaweza kuwa na nia njema, lakini kutenda bila ruhusa bado kunaweza kuvunja sheria.",
     "Ukigundua udhaifu kwa bahati, simama, usichunguze zaidi wala kunakili data, na uripoti kwa mmiliki au mamlaka. Mashirika yatoe njia rahisi na salama ya kupokea ripoti hizo."),
    ("script-kiddie", "Script kiddie", ["script kiddie", "script kiddies", "skiddie", "unskilled attacker", "amateur hacker", "débutant pirate", "pirate amateur", "mdukuzi mwanzilishi", "umunyabyaha utarabihugukirwa"], "people", "teenager using a computer at home",
     {"fr": "Script kiddie (pirate amateur)", "sw": "Script kiddie (mdukuzi asiye na ujuzi anayetumia zana za wengine)", "rw": "Script kiddie (umuntu udafite ubumenyi ukoresha ibikoresho by'abandi)"},
     "A slang term for an inexperienced person who uses ready-made tools made by others to attack systems, without understanding how they work. Despite low skill, the harm caused can still be real.",
     "Such attackers go for easy targets, so basic hygiene is effective: updates, strong passwords and two-step verification. Young people curious about security should learn in legal practice labs instead.",
     "Terme d'argot pour une personne peu expérimentée qui utilise des outils tout faits créés par d'autres pour attaquer des systèmes sans comprendre leur fonctionnement. Malgré un faible niveau, les dégâts peuvent être réels.",
     "Ces attaquants visent les cibles faciles, donc l'hygiène de base est efficace : mises à jour, mots de passe solides et vérification en deux étapes. Les jeunes curieux devraient apprendre dans des laboratoires légaux.",
     "Ni izina ry'inzaduka ry'umuntu udafite uburambe ukoresha ibikoresho byamaze gukorwa n'abandi mu gutera sisitemu atazi uko bikora. Nubwo afite ubumenyi buke, ibyago ateza bishobora kuba byinshi.",
     "Abo bagizi ba nabi bahitamo ibyoroshye, bityo isuku y'ibanze irakora: kuvugurura, amagambo y'ibanga akomeye no kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri. Urubyiruko rushishikajwe n'umutekano rwigire mu ma laboratwari yemewe.",
     "Ni neno la mtaani kwa mtu asiye na uzoefu anayetumia zana zilizotengenezwa tayari na wengine kushambulia mifumo bila kuelewa zinavyofanya kazi. Ingawa ujuzi ni mdogo, madhara yanaweza kuwa halisi.",
     "Washambuliaji hao hulenga walio rahisi, kwa hivyo usafi wa msingi hufaa: masasisho, nenosiri imara na uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili. Vijana wenye udadisi wajifunze katika maabara halali za mazoezi."),
    ("hacktivism", "Hacktivism", ["hacktivism", "hacktivist", "hacktivists", "hacktivisme", "hacktiviste", "udukuzi wa kiharakati", "ubukangurambaga bwo gutera sisitemu", "political hacking"], "people", "protest crowd with banners",
     {"fr": "Hacktivisme", "sw": "Hacktivism (udukuzi wa kiharakati)", "rw": "Hacktivism (ibitero by'ikoranabuhanga bigamije politiki cyangwa impinduka)"},
     "The use of hacking techniques, such as defacing websites or overloading them, to make a political or social point. Supporters call it protest; courts usually treat unauthorised access as a crime.",
     "Hacktivists often target organisations linked to a cause in the news. Organisations should keep websites patched, have a plan for outages and defacement, and be able to restore from clean backups.",
     "Usage de techniques de piratage, comme défigurer ou saturer des sites, pour défendre une cause politique ou sociale. Ses partisans parlent de protestation ; la justice traite en général l'accès non autorisé comme un délit.",
     "Les hacktivistes visent souvent des organisations liées à une cause d'actualité. Gardez les sites à jour, prévoyez un plan en cas d'indisponibilité ou de défiguration et sachez restaurer depuis des sauvegardes saines.",
     "Ni ugukoresha uburyo bwo gutera sisitemu, nko guhindura isura y'imbuga cyangwa kuzuzuza ubusabe, hagamijwe gutanga ubutumwa bwa politiki cyangwa bw'imibereho. Ababushyigikiye babwita imyigaragambyo; inkiko akenshi zibona kwinjira nta ruhushya nk'icyaha.",
     "Abakora ibi bakunze kwibasira ibigo bifitanye isano n'ikibazo kiri mu makuru. Ibigo bikomeze kuvugurura imbuga, bigire gahunda yo guhangana n'ihagarara cyangwa guhindurwa kw'urubuga, kandi bibashe kugarura kopi zisukuye.",
     "Ni matumizi ya mbinu za udukuzi, kama kubadilisha mwonekano wa tovuti au kuzilemea, kutoa ujumbe wa kisiasa au kijamii. Wafuasi huuita maandamano; mahakama kwa kawaida huchukulia ufikiaji bila ruhusa kama kosa.",
     "Wanaharakati hao mara nyingi hulenga mashirika yanayohusiana na suala lililo habarini. Mashirika yasasishe tovuti, yawe na mpango wa kukatika au kubadilishwa mwonekano, na yaweze kurejesha kutoka nakala rudufu safi."),
    ("cybercriminal", "Cybercriminal", ["cybercriminal", "cyber criminal", "cybercriminals", "cybercrime", "cybercriminel", "cybercriminalité", "mhalifu wa mtandao", "umugizi wa nabi wa interineti"], "people", "police officer at a computer",
     {"fr": "Cybercriminel", "sw": "Mhalifu wa mtandao (cybercriminal)", "rw": "Umugizi wa nabi wa interineti (cybercriminal)"},
     "A person or group that commits crimes using computers and networks, such as fraud, theft of data, extortion with ransomware or scams, usually to make money.",
     "Most ordinary people meet them as scam messages, fake websites and mobile-money fraud. Do not pay on pressure, verify requests through a known number, and report crimes to the police or the national cybercrime unit.",
     "Personne ou groupe qui commet des délits au moyen d'ordinateurs et de réseaux : fraude, vol de données, extorsion par rançongiciel ou arnaques, généralement pour gagner de l'argent.",
     "La plupart des gens les rencontrent via des messages d'arnaque, faux sites et fraudes au mobile money. Ne payez pas sous pression, vérifiez par un numéro connu et signalez les délits à la police ou à l'unité nationale de cybercriminalité.",
     "Ni umuntu cyangwa itsinda rikora ibyaha rikoresheje mudasobwa n'imiyoboro, nko uburiganya, kwiba amakuru, gusaba incungu ukoresheje ransomware cyangwa ubutekamutwe, akenshi hagamijwe amafaranga.",
     "Abantu benshi bahura na bo mu butumwa bw'ubutekamutwe, imbuga z'ibinyoma n'uburiganya bwa mobile money. Ntukishyure ubihatiwe, genzura usaba ukoresheje nimero uzi, kandi umenyeshe polisi ibyaha.",
     "Ni mtu au kikundi kinachofanya uhalifu kwa kutumia kompyuta na mitandao, kama ulaghai, wizi wa data, kujipatia fedha kwa ransomware au utapeli, kwa kawaida kwa lengo la fedha.",
     "Watu wengi hukutana nao kupitia jumbe za ulaghai, tovuti bandia na ulaghai wa pesa za simu. Usilipe kwa shinikizo, thibitisha ombi kwa namba unayoijua na ripoti uhalifu kwa polisi."),
    ("nation-state-actor", "Nation-state actor", ["nation-state actor", "nation state actor", "state-sponsored hackers", "state sponsored", "nation state", "acteur étatique", "acteur etatique", "mshambuliaji wa kiserikali", "abagizi ba nabi bakorera leta"], "people", "government building with flag",
     {"fr": "Acteur étatique", "sw": "Nation-state actor (mshambuliaji anayefadhiliwa na taifa)", "rw": "Nation-state actor (itsinda rikorera cyangwa rishyigikiwe na leta)"},
     "A hacking group that works for, or is backed by, a government, usually for spying, influence or disruption. Such groups are generally well-funded and patient, and often attributed to a state only with caution.",
     "Most people are not their main targets, but governments, telecoms, energy, journalists and activists can be. These groups need strong basics: updates, two-step verification, limited access and reporting odd activity early.",
     "Groupe de pirates travaillant pour un gouvernement ou soutenu par lui, généralement pour l'espionnage, l'influence ou la perturbation. Ces groupes sont bien financés et patients, et leur attribution à un État se fait avec prudence.",
     "La plupart des gens ne sont pas leurs cibles principales, mais administrations, opérateurs, énergie, journalistes et militants peuvent l'être. Il faut des bases solides : mises à jour, double vérification, accès limités, signalement précoce.",
     "Ni itsinda ry'abatera sisitemu rikorera leta cyangwa ritewe inkunga na yo, akenshi rigamije gutata, gushyira igitutu cyangwa guhungabanya. Aya matsinda aba afite amafaranga n'igihe, kandi kuyahuza na leta bikorwa ubushishozi.",
     "Abantu benshi si bo bibasirwa cyane, ariko ibigo bya leta, itumanaho, ingufu, abanyamakuru n'abaharanira uburenganzira bashobora kwibasirwa. Hakenewe ibanze bikomeye: kuvugurura, kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri, kugabanya uburenganzira no gutanga amakuru hakiri kare.",
     "Ni kikundi cha wadukuzi kinachofanya kazi kwa serikali au kinachoungwa mkono nayo, kwa kawaida kwa ujasusi, ushawishi au kuvuruga. Vikundi hivi vina ufadhili na uvumilivu, na kuhusishwa na taifa hufanywa kwa tahadhari.",
     "Watu wengi si walengwa wakuu, lakini serikali, kampuni za mawasiliano, nishati, waandishi wa habari na wanaharakati wanaweza kuwa. Misingi imara inahitajika: masasisho, uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili, ufikiaji mdogo na kuripoti mapema."),
    ("devsecops", "DevSecOps", ["devsecops", "dev sec ops", "secure devops", "security in devops", "devsecops pipeline", "sécurité devops", "securite devops", "usalama katika devops", "umutekano mu bikorwa bya devops"], "appsec", "software team working at standing desks",
     {"fr": "DevSecOps", "sw": "DevSecOps (usalama ndani ya uundaji wa programu)", "rw": "DevSecOps (umutekano mu gukora no gukoresha porogaramu)"},
     "A way of building and running software in which security checks are part of every step, from design to release, instead of being added once at the end.",
     "Teams add automatic scans, code review and secret checks to the process that builds and deploys the software. Small teams can begin simply: review changes, keep dependencies updated and never store passwords in code.",
     "Manière de concevoir et d'exploiter des logiciels où les contrôles de sécurité font partie de chaque étape, de la conception à la mise en production, au lieu d'être ajoutés à la fin.",
     "Les équipes ajoutent des analyses automatiques, relectures de code et détection de secrets au processus de construction et de déploiement. Une petite équipe peut commencer simplement : relire les changements, mettre à jour les dépendances, ne jamais stocker de mots de passe dans le code.",
     "Ni uburyo bwo gukora no gukoresha porogaramu aho ibigenzura by'umutekano biba mu ntambwe zose, uhereye ku igishushanyo kugeza ku isohoka, aho kubishyira ku iherezo gusa.",
     "Amatsinda yongeramo gusuzuma byikora, gusuzumana code no gushakisha amabanga mu nzira yubaka kandi igashyira porogaramu mu bikorwa. Itsinda rito rishobora gutangirana n'ibyoroshye: gusuzuma impinduka, kuvugurura ibyo porogaramu ikoresha no kudasiga amagambo y'ibanga muri code.",
     "Ni njia ya kujenga na kuendesha programu ambapo ukaguzi wa usalama ni sehemu ya kila hatua, kuanzia usanifu hadi utoaji, badala ya kuongezwa mwishoni tu.",
     "Timu huongeza uchanganuzi wa kiotomatiki, ukaguzi wa msimbo na ukaguzi wa siri kwenye mchakato wa kujenga na kusambaza. Timu ndogo zinaweza kuanza rahisi: kukagua mabadiliko, kusasisha vitegemezi na kutohifadhi nenosiri kwenye msimbo."),
    ("static-and-dynamic-testing", "SAST and DAST (static and dynamic testing)", ["sast", "dast", "sast and dast", "static analysis", "dynamic analysis", "static application security testing", "dynamic application security testing", "analyse statique", "analyse dynamique", "upimaji tuli na wa nguvu"], "appsec", "programmer testing software on screen",
     {"fr": "SAST et DAST (tests statiques et dynamiques)", "sw": "SAST na DAST (upimaji tuli na wa nguvu)", "rw": "SAST na DAST (gusuzuma code no gusuzuma porogaramu iri gukora)"},
     "Two ways to test software for security flaws. Static testing (SAST) reads the source code without running it; dynamic testing (DAST) probes the running application from outside, as a user or attacker would.",
     "They find different problems, so teams often use both. Run them on your own software, preferably automatically on every change, and treat their results as leads to review since both can give false alarms.",
     "Deux façons de tester un logiciel pour y trouver des failles. Le test statique (SAST) lit le code source sans l'exécuter ; le test dynamique (DAST) sonde l'application en fonctionnement, de l'extérieur, comme le ferait un utilisateur ou un attaquant.",
     "Ils trouvent des problèmes différents, donc les équipes utilisent souvent les deux. Lancez-les sur vos propres logiciels, de préférence automatiquement à chaque changement, et vérifiez leurs résultats car de fausses alertes sont possibles.",
     "Ni inzira ebyiri zo gusuzuma porogaramu ushakisha intege nke. Static (SAST) isoma code utayikoresheje; dynamic (DAST) igerageza porogaramu iri gukora iri hanze, nk'uko umukoresha cyangwa umugizi wa nabi yabikora.",
     "Zibona ibibazo bitandukanye, bityo amatsinda akunze gukoresha zombi. Zikoreshe kuri porogaramu zawe, byaba byiza byikora kuri buri mpinduka, kandi ibisubizo ubifate nk'ibyo gusuzuma kuko bishobora kuba impuruza z'ibinyoma.",
     "Ni njia mbili za kupima programu kutafuta dosari za usalama. Upimaji tuli (SAST) husoma msimbo bila kuuendesha; upimaji wa nguvu (DAST) hujaribu programu inayoendeshwa kutoka nje, kama mtumiaji au mshambuliaji.",
     "Hupata matatizo tofauti, kwa hivyo timu mara nyingi hutumia zote. Ziendeshe kwenye programu yako, ikiwezekana kiotomatiki kila mabadiliko, na zichukulie matokeo kama vidokezo vya kukagua kwani zinaweza kutoa tahadhari za uongo."),
    ("fuzzing", "Fuzzing", ["fuzzing", "fuzz testing", "fuzzer", "fuzz test", "test à données aléatoires", "fuzzing logiciel", "kupima kwa data holela", "gupima porogaramu ukoresheje amakuru adateganyijwe"], "appsec", "software testing lab with monitors",
     {"fr": "Fuzzing (test par données aléatoires)", "sw": "Fuzzing (kupima kwa data holela)", "rw": "Fuzzing (gupima porogaramu ukoresheje amakuru adateganyijwe)"},
     "A testing method that feeds a program large amounts of unexpected, random or malformed data to see whether it crashes or misbehaves, which can reveal hidden security flaws.",
     "Software makers use fuzzing before releasing programs that handle files, messages or network data. Developers should fuzz only their own software or systems they are allowed to test, and fix the crashes found.",
     "Méthode de test qui envoie à un programme de grandes quantités de données inattendues, aléatoires ou malformées pour voir s'il plante ou se comporte mal, ce qui peut révéler des failles cachées.",
     "Les éditeurs l'utilisent avant de publier des programmes qui traitent des fichiers, messages ou données réseau. Ne fuzzez que vos propres logiciels ou ceux que vous avez le droit de tester, et corrigez les plantages trouvés.",
     "Ni uburyo bwo gupima aho porogaramu ihabwa amakuru menshi adateganyijwe, adahuje cyangwa yangiritse, harebwa niba ihagarara cyangwa ikora nabi, bigashobora kugaragaza intege nke zihishe.",
     "Abakora porogaramu barabukoresha mbere yo gusohora porogaramu zitunganya dosiye, ubutumwa cyangwa amakuru y'imiyoboro. Gerageza gusa porogaramu zawe cyangwa izo wemerewe gupima, kandi ukosore ibyahagaritse porogaramu.",
     "Ni njia ya kupima inayopa programu kiasi kikubwa cha data isiyotarajiwa, holela au iliyoharibika ili kuona kama inaanguka au inafanya kazi vibaya, jambo linaloweza kufichua dosari zilizofichika.",
     "Watengenezaji hutumia kabla ya kutoa programu zinazoshughulikia faili, ujumbe au data ya mtandao. Pima programu zako au ulizoruhusiwa tu, na urekebishe hitilafu zilizopatikana."),
    ("reverse-engineering", "Reverse engineering", ["reverse engineering", "reversing", "reverse engineer", "disassembly", "rétro-ingénierie", "retro-ingenierie", "ingénierie inverse", "uhandisi geuzi", "gusesengura porogaramu ucyuma"], "operations", "circuit board close up",
     {"fr": "Rétro-ingénierie", "sw": "Reverse engineering (uhandisi geuzi)", "rw": "Reverse engineering (gusesengura porogaramu cyangwa igikoresho kugira ngo wumve uko gikora)"},
     "Taking apart a program or device to understand how it works without having its design documents. Security analysts use it, for example, to study how a piece of malware behaves.",
     "It is a specialist skill used by malware analysts and researchers. Rules differ between countries and licences, so legality depends on the situation; ask a qualified adviser before analysing software you do not own.",
     "Démonter un programme ou un appareil pour comprendre son fonctionnement sans disposer de ses plans. Les analystes de sécurité s'en servent par exemple pour étudier le comportement d'un logiciel malveillant.",
     "C'est une compétence de spécialistes (analystes de malwares, chercheurs). Les règles varient selon les pays et les licences, donc la légalité dépend du cas ; demandez conseil à un professionnel avant d'analyser un logiciel qui n'est pas le vôtre.",
     "Ni ugusesengura porogaramu cyangwa igikoresho kugira ngo wumve uko gikora nta byangombwa by'igishushanyo. Abasesenguzi b'umutekano barabikoresha, nko kwiga imikorere ya malware.",
     "Ni ubumenyi bw'inzobere (abasesenguzi ba malware, abashakashatsi). Amategeko atandukana hagati y'ibihugu n'uruhushya rw'ikoreshwa, bityo kwemerwa biterwa n'imimerere; baza umujyanama ubizi mbere yo gusesengura porogaramu atari iyawe.",
     "Ni kuchambua programu au kifaa ili kuelewa kinavyofanya kazi bila kuwa na nyaraka za usanifu. Wachambuzi wa usalama huitumia, kwa mfano, kusoma tabia ya programu hasidi.",
     "Ni ujuzi wa kitaalamu unaotumiwa na wachambuzi wa programu hasidi na watafiti. Sheria hutofautiana kati ya nchi na leseni, kwa hivyo uhalali hutegemea hali; wasiliana na mshauri kabla ya kuchambua programu isiyo yako."),
    ("patch-management", "Patch management", ["patch management", "patching", "patch policy", "apply patches", "gestion des correctifs", "gestion des patchs", "usimamizi wa viraka", "gucunga ibikosorwa bya porogaramu", "patch cycle"], "defense", "IT technician updating computers",
     {"fr": "Gestion des correctifs", "sw": "Patch management (usimamizi wa viraka vya usalama)", "rw": "Patch management (gucunga ivugurura ry'umutekano)"},
     "The routine of finding, testing and installing the fixes (patches) that software makers release for security flaws, on every computer, phone, server and device in an organisation.",
     "Keep a list of what you run, install critical patches quickly, and retire software that no longer gets fixes. Test important updates first on a few machines, and keep backups in case an update causes trouble.",
     "Routine consistant à repérer, tester et installer les correctifs publiés par les éditeurs pour des failles de sécurité, sur chaque ordinateur, téléphone, serveur et appareil d'une organisation.",
     "Tenez la liste de ce que vous utilisez, installez vite les correctifs critiques et abandonnez les logiciels qui ne reçoivent plus de correctifs. Testez d'abord les mises à jour importantes sur quelques machines et gardez des sauvegardes.",
     "Ni umuco wo gushaka, gupima no gushyiraho ibikosorwa (patches) abakora porogaramu basohora ku ntege nke z'umutekano, kuri buri mudasobwa, telefone, seriveri n'igikoresho cy'ikigo.",
     "Bika urutonde rw'ibyo ukoresha, shyiraho vuba ibikosorwa by'ingenzi, kandi uhagarike porogaramu zitagikosorwa. Gerageza ivugurura rikomeye ku mashini nke mbere, kandi ubike kopi mu gihe ivugurura ryateza ikibazo.",
     "Ni utaratibu wa kutafuta, kupima na kusakinisha marekebisho (patches) yanayotolewa na watengenezaji kwa dosari za usalama, kwenye kila kompyuta, simu, seva na kifaa cha shirika.",
     "Weka orodha ya unachotumia, sakinisha viraka muhimu haraka na acha programu zisizopata marekebisho tena. Jaribu masasisho muhimu kwanza kwenye mashine chache na uwe na nakala rudufu."),
    ("software-updates", "Software updates", ["software updates", "software update", "update software", "keep software updated", "mises à jour", "mise à jour logicielle", "masasisho ya programu", "kuvugurura porogaramu", "auto update"], "defense", "smartphone showing update screen",
     {"fr": "Mises à jour logicielles", "sw": "Masasisho ya programu (software updates)", "rw": "Kuvugurura porogaramu (software updates)"},
     "New versions of apps, operating systems and device firmware that add features and, importantly, fix security flaws that criminals already know about.",
     "Turn on automatic updates on phones and computers, restart when asked, and update apps from official stores only. Be wary of pop-ups that offer fake updates; install them from settings or the official store.",
     "Nouvelles versions d'applications, de systèmes d'exploitation et de micrologiciels qui ajoutent des fonctions et surtout corrigent des failles de sécurité déjà connues des criminels.",
     "Activez les mises à jour automatiques sur téléphones et ordinateurs, redémarrez quand on vous le demande et n'installez les applis que depuis les boutiques officielles. Méfiez-vous des fenêtres proposant de fausses mises à jour.",
     "Ni inyandiko nshya za porogaramu, sisitemu y'imikorere n'ibikoresho byongera ibishya kandi cyane cyane bikosora intege nke z'umutekano abagizi ba nabi basanzwe bazi.",
     "Shyiraho kuvugurura byikora kuri telefone na mudasobwa, wongere utangire iyo bisabwe, kandi ushyire porogaramu uzivanye ku bubiko bwemewe gusa. Wirinde utubuto tugaragara tuvuga ko ari ivugurura ry'ibinyoma.",
     "Ni matoleo mapya ya programu, mifumo ya uendeshaji na programu dhibiti yanayoongeza vipengele na muhimu zaidi kurekebisha dosari za usalama ambazo wahalifu tayari wanazijua.",
     "Washa masasisho ya kiotomatiki kwenye simu na kompyuta, washa upya unapoombwa, na pakua programu kutoka maduka rasmi tu. Jihadhari na madirisha yanayotoa masasisho bandia."),
    ("cloud-security", "Cloud security", ["cloud security", "securing the cloud", "cloud computing security", "sécurité du cloud", "securite du cloud", "sécurité cloud", "usalama wa cloud", "umutekano wa cloud", "cloud storage security"], "cloud", "data center corridor",
     {"fr": "Sécurité du cloud", "sw": "Usalama wa cloud", "rw": "Umutekano wa cloud"},
     "Protecting data, apps and accounts that live on internet-based services such as online storage, email or hosted servers, rather than on equipment you own.",
     "Use strong passwords and two-step verification on cloud accounts, share files only with named people, check that storage is not set to public, and know where your provider keeps backups and how to recover.",
     "Protection des données, applications et comptes hébergés sur des services en ligne comme le stockage, la messagerie ou des serveurs loués, plutôt que sur du matériel qui vous appartient.",
     "Utilisez des mots de passe solides et la vérification en deux étapes, partagez les fichiers avec des personnes nommées, vérifiez que le stockage n'est pas public et sachez où le fournisseur garde les sauvegardes.",
     "Ni ukurinda amakuru, porogaramu na konti biri kuri serivisi zo kuri interineti nk'ububiko bwo kuri murandasi, imeri cyangwa seriveri zikodeshwa, aho kuba ku bikoresho ufite.",
     "Koresha amagambo y'ibanga akomeye no kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri kuri konti za cloud, sangiza dosiye abantu bazwi gusa, genzura ko ububiko butari rusange, kandi umenye aho utanga serivisi abika kopi.",
     "Ni kulinda data, programu na akaunti zilizo kwenye huduma za mtandaoni kama hifadhi, barua pepe au seva za kukodi, badala ya vifaa unavyomiliki.",
     "Tumia nenosiri imara na uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili kwenye akaunti za cloud, shiriki faili na watu mahususi tu, hakikisha hifadhi si ya umma na ujue mtoa huduma anaweka nakala rudufu wapi."),
    ("shared-responsibility-model", "Shared responsibility model", ["shared responsibility model", "shared responsibility", "cloud shared responsibility", "modèle de responsabilité partagée", "responsabilité partagée", "modele de responsabilite partagee", "wajibu wa pamoja", "inshingano zisangiwe"], "cloud", "server racks in a data center",
     {"fr": "Modèle de responsabilité partagée", "sw": "Mfumo wa wajibu wa pamoja (shared responsibility model)", "rw": "Shared responsibility model (inshingano zisangiwe hagati y'utanga serivisi n'umukiriya)"},
     "The principle that, in cloud services, the provider is responsible for securing the underlying infrastructure while the customer remains responsible for how they use it: accounts, settings, data and users.",
     "The exact split depends on the service type and the contract. Customers should read what is covered, manage their own access and settings, and not assume the provider will protect data they left open.",
     "Principe selon lequel, dans les services cloud, le fournisseur sécurise l'infrastructure sous-jacente tandis que le client reste responsable de son usage : comptes, réglages, données et utilisateurs.",
     "Le partage exact dépend du type de service et du contrat. Les clients doivent lire ce qui est couvert, gérer leurs accès et réglages, et ne pas supposer que le fournisseur protège des données laissées ouvertes.",
     "Ni ihame rivuga ko muri serivisi za cloud utanga serivisi ashinzwe umutekano w'ibikorwa remezo, naho umukiriya agakomeza kubazwa uko abikoresha: konti, imiterere, amakuru n'abakoresha.",
     "Ibice by'inshingano biterwa n'ubwoko bwa serivisi n'amasezerano. Abakiriya basome ibyo bikubiyemo, bagenzure uburenganzira n'imiterere byabo, kandi ntibatekereze ko utanga serivisi azarinda amakuru basize afunguye.",
     "Ni kanuni kwamba katika huduma za cloud, mtoa huduma anawajibika kulinda miundombinu ya msingi huku mteja akibaki kuwajibika kwa matumizi yake: akaunti, mipangilio, data na watumiaji.",
     "Mgawanyo kamili hutegemea aina ya huduma na mkataba. Wateja wasome kinachofunikwa, wadhibiti ufikiaji na mipangilio yao, na wasidhani mtoa huduma atalinda data waliyoiacha wazi."),
    ("container-security", "Container security", ["container security", "docker security", "kubernetes security", "containers", "sécurité des conteneurs", "securite des conteneurs", "usalama wa makontena", "umutekano wa containers", "container image scanning"], "cloud", "data center servers",
     {"fr": "Sécurité des conteneurs", "sw": "Usalama wa containers (makontena ya programu)", "rw": "Umutekano wa containers (porogaramu zipakiye mu bikoresho byihariye)"},
     "Protecting containers, which are lightweight packages that bundle an application with what it needs to run, and the systems that manage them, from vulnerable software, wrong settings and excess permissions.",
     "Teams use trusted base images, scan them for known flaws, keep them updated, avoid storing secrets inside and run them with minimal rights. Small organisations using hosted services should check the provider's defaults.",
     "Protéger les conteneurs, ces paquets légers qui regroupent une application et ce dont elle a besoin pour fonctionner, ainsi que les systèmes qui les gèrent, contre les logiciels vulnérables, mauvais réglages et droits excessifs.",
     "Les équipes utilisent des images de base fiables, les analysent, les tiennent à jour, n'y stockent pas de secrets et les exécutent avec des droits minimaux. Les petites structures sur services gérés vérifient les réglages par défaut du fournisseur.",
     "Ni ukurinda containers, ni ipaki zoroheje zihuriza porogaramu n'ibyo ikenera gukora, hamwe na sisitemu zibicunga, ngo zitagira porogaramu zifite intege nke, imiterere mibi n'uburenganzira burenze.",
     "Amatsinda akoresha amashusho y'ibanze yizewe, akayasuzuma, akayavugurura, ntabikemo amabanga kandi akayakoresha afite uburenganzira buto. Ibigo bito bikoresha serivisi zicungwa bigenzura imiterere y'ibanze y'utanga serivisi.",
     "Ni kulinda makontena, vifurushi vyepesi vinavyokusanya programu na kinachohitajika kuiendesha, na mifumo inayoyasimamia, dhidi ya programu zenye udhaifu, mipangilio mibaya na ruhusa nyingi kupita kiasi.",
     "Timu hutumia picha za msingi zinazoaminika, huzichanganua, kuzisasisha, hazihifadhi siri ndani na huziendesha kwa ruhusa ndogo. Mashirika madogo yanayotumia huduma zinazosimamiwa yakague mipangilio ya awali ya mtoa huduma."),
    ("mobile-device-security", "Mobile device security", ["mobile device security", "phone security", "smartphone security", "mobile security", "sécurité mobile", "securite mobile", "sécurité des appareils mobiles", "usalama wa simu", "umutekano wa telefone"], "cloud", "person holding a smartphone",
     {"fr": "Sécurité des appareils mobiles", "sw": "Usalama wa simu na vifaa vya mkononi", "rw": "Umutekano wa telefone n'ibikoresho bigendanwa"},
     "Protecting phones and tablets, and the data and accounts on them, from theft, loss, harmful apps, unsafe networks and attacks that arrive by message or call.",
     "Use a screen lock, keep the system and apps updated, install apps from official stores only, check app permissions, enable find-my-device and back up. Protect your SIM and mobile-money PIN and never share one-time codes.",
     "Protéger téléphones et tablettes, ainsi que leurs données et comptes, contre le vol, la perte, les applis malveillantes, les réseaux risqués et les attaques par message ou appel.",
     "Mettez un verrouillage d'écran, gardez système et applis à jour, installez uniquement depuis les boutiques officielles, vérifiez les autorisations, activez la localisation de l'appareil et sauvegardez. Protégez votre SIM et code mobile money ; ne partagez jamais un code à usage unique.",
     "Ni ukurinda telefone na tablet, hamwe n'amakuru na konti biriho, kutibwa, kubura, porogaramu mbi, imiyoboro itizewe n'ibitero bizanwa n'ubutumwa cyangwa guhamagara.",
     "Shyiraho ijambo ry'ibanga rifunga telefone, uvugurure sisitemu na porogaramu, ushyireho porogaramu ziva ku bubiko bwemewe gusa, ugenzure uburenganzira bwazo, ushyireho gushakisha telefone kandi ubike kopi. Rinda SIM yawe na PIN ya mobile money; ntuzigere utanga code imwe yo gukoresha.",
     "Ni kulinda simu na kompyuta kibao, na data na akaunti zilizomo, dhidi ya wizi, kupotea, programu hasidi, mitandao isiyo salama na mashambulizi yanayokuja kwa ujumbe au simu.",
     "Weka kufuli ya skrini, sasisha mfumo na programu, pakua kutoka maduka rasmi tu, kagua ruhusa za programu, washa utafutaji wa kifaa na uhifadhi nakala rudufu. Linda SIM na PIN ya pesa za simu; usishiriki msimbo wa mara moja."),
    ("byod", "BYOD (bring your own device)", ["byod", "bring your own device", "personal devices at work", "use own phone for work", "apportez votre propre appareil", "apportez votre appareil", "kutumia kifaa chako kazini", "gukoresha telefone yawe ku kazi", "ave"], "cloud", "employees using personal laptops in an office",
     {"fr": "BYOD (apportez votre équipement personnel)", "sw": "BYOD (kutumia kifaa chako binafsi kazini)", "rw": "BYOD (gukoresha igikoresho cyawe bwite ku kazi)"},
     "A policy that lets staff, students or members use their own phones and laptops for work or school. It saves cost but mixes personal and organisational data on devices the organisation does not fully control.",
     "Set clear written rules: screen lock, updates, no sharing of devices, separation of work and personal data, and what happens if a device is lost. Only allow access to what each person needs, with two-step verification.",
     "Politique qui permet au personnel, aux élèves ou aux membres d'utiliser leurs propres téléphones et ordinateurs pour le travail ou l'école. Elle réduit les coûts mais mélange données personnelles et professionnelles sur des appareils que l'organisation ne maîtrise pas.",
     "Fixez des règles écrites claires : verrouillage, mises à jour, pas de partage d'appareil, séparation des données pro et perso, et marche à suivre en cas de perte. N'accordez que les accès nécessaires, avec vérification en deux étapes.",
     "Ni politiki yemerera abakozi, abanyeshuri cyangwa abanyamuryango gukoresha telefone na mudasobwa byabo ku kazi cyangwa mu ishuri. Igabanya ikiguzi ariko ivanga amakuru bwite n'ay'ikigo ku bikoresho ikigo kidafiteho ubushobozi bwuzuye.",
     "Shyiraho amategeko yanditse asobanutse: gufunga, kuvugurura, kudasangira igikoresho, gutandukanya amakuru y'akazi n'ay'umuntu, n'ibigomba gukorwa iyo igikoresho cyabuze. Emerera buri wese ibyo akeneye gusa, hamwe no kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri.",
     "Ni sera inayoruhusu wafanyakazi, wanafunzi au wanachama kutumia simu na kompyuta zao binafsi kwa kazi au shule. Inapunguza gharama lakini inachanganya data binafsi na ya shirika kwenye vifaa ambavyo shirika halidhibiti kikamilifu.",
     "Weka kanuni wazi zilizoandikwa: kufuli, masasisho, kutoshiriki kifaa, kutenganisha data ya kazi na binafsi, na hatua kifaa kikipotea. Ruhusu ufikiaji unaohitajika tu, pamoja na uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili."),
    ("shadow-it", "Shadow IT", ["shadow it", "shadow it risk", "unapproved apps", "unsanctioned software", "informatique fantôme", "informatique fantome", "it fantôme", "teknolojia kivuli", "ikoranabuhanga ritemewe"], "cloud", "office worker using unfamiliar apps on laptop",
     {"fr": "Shadow IT (informatique fantôme)", "sw": "Shadow IT (matumizi ya teknolojia isiyoidhinishwa kazini)", "rw": "Shadow IT (gukoresha ikoranabuhanga ritemewe n'ikigo)"},
     "Apps, services or devices that staff use for work without the knowledge or approval of the IT or security team, for example sending work files through a personal storage account or messaging app.",
     "It usually starts with good intentions but hides data from the organisation's protection and backups. Offer approved, easy tools, explain the rules and let people ask for what they need rather than banning without alternatives.",
     "Applications, services ou appareils utilisés au travail à l'insu ou sans l'accord du service informatique ou sécurité, par exemple envoyer des fichiers professionnels via un compte de stockage personnel ou une messagerie privée.",
     "Cela commence souvent avec de bonnes intentions mais soustrait les données à la protection et aux sauvegardes de l'organisation. Proposez des outils approuvés et simples, expliquez les règles et laissez les gens demander ce qu'il leur faut.",
     "Ni porogaramu, serivisi cyangwa ibikoresho abakozi bakoresha ku kazi ikipe y'ikoranabuhanga cyangwa y'umutekano itabizi cyangwa itabyemeye, nko kohereza dosiye z'akazi ukoresheje konti y'ububiko bwite cyangwa porogaramu y'ubutumwa bwite.",
     "Bikunze gutangira n'umutima mwiza ariko bigahisha amakuru uburinzi na kopi z'ikigo. Tanga ibikoresho byemewe kandi byoroshye, usobanure amategeko kandi uhe abantu uburyo bwo gusaba ibyo bakeneye aho kubabuza gusa.",
     "Ni programu, huduma au vifaa vinavyotumiwa na wafanyakazi kazini bila timu ya TEHAMA au usalama kujua au kuidhinisha, kwa mfano kutuma faili za kazi kupitia akaunti binafsi ya hifadhi au programu ya ujumbe.",
     "Mara nyingi huanza kwa nia njema lakini hufichya data kutoka kwa ulinzi na nakala rudufu za shirika. Toa zana rahisi zilizoidhinishwa, eleza kanuni na waruhusu watu waombe wanachohitaji badala ya kukataza tu."),
    ("backup", "Backup (3-2-1 rule)", ["backup", "backups", "3-2-1 rule", "3 2 1 backup", "data backup", "sauvegarde", "sauvegardes", "règle 3-2-1", "nakala rudufu", "kubika kopi"], "operations", "external hard drive backup",
     {"fr": "Sauvegarde (règle 3-2-1)", "sw": "Nakala rudufu (backup, kanuni ya 3-2-1)", "rw": "Kubika kopi (backup, ihame rya 3-2-1)"},
     "An extra copy of your data kept separately so you can recover after loss, theft, damage or ransomware. The common 3-2-1 rule means three copies, on two kinds of storage, with one copy kept off-site.",
     "Back up photos, school records and business files regularly, and keep at least one copy disconnected or offline so ransomware cannot reach it. Test a restore occasionally; a backup you have never restored may not work.",
     "Copie supplémentaire de vos données, gardée séparément pour pouvoir récupérer après une perte, un vol, un dommage ou un rançongiciel. La règle 3-2-1 : trois copies, sur deux types de supports, dont une hors site.",
     "Sauvegardez régulièrement photos, dossiers scolaires et fichiers d'entreprise, et gardez au moins une copie déconnectée pour qu'un rançongiciel ne l'atteigne pas. Testez la restauration de temps en temps ; une sauvegarde jamais restaurée peut ne pas fonctionner.",
     "Ni kopi y'inyongera y'amakuru yawe ibitswe ukwayo kugira ngo ushobore kuyagarura nyuma yo kubura, kwibwa, kwangirika cyangwa ransomware. Ihame rya 3-2-1: kopi eshatu, ku bwoko bubiri bw'ububiko, imwe ibitswe ahandi.",
     "Bika kopi y'amafoto, inyandiko z'ishuri n'amadosiye y'ubucuruzi buri gihe, kandi ugumane nibura imwe itari ku murongo ngo ransomware itayigeraho. Gerageza kuyigarura rimwe na rimwe; kopi utigeze ugarura ntushobora kumenya ko ikora.",
     "Ni nakala ya ziada ya data yako inayohifadhiwa tofauti ili uweze kurejesha baada ya kupotea, wizi, uharibifu au ransomware. Kanuni ya 3-2-1: nakala tatu, kwenye aina mbili za hifadhi, moja ikiwa mahali pengine.",
     "Hifadhi nakala ya picha, rekodi za shule na faili za biashara mara kwa mara, na weka angalau nakala moja nje ya mtandao ili ransomware isiifikie. Jaribu kurejesha mara kwa mara; nakala ambayo hujawahi kuirejesha huenda isifanye kazi."),
    ("disaster-recovery", "Disaster recovery", ["disaster recovery", "dr plan", "drp", "it disaster recovery", "reprise après sinistre", "plan de reprise d'activité", "plan de reprise", "urejeshaji baada ya maafa", "kongera kugarura sisitemu nyuma y'ibiza"], "operations", "backup generator and server room",
     {"fr": "Reprise après sinistre (PRA)", "sw": "Urejeshaji baada ya maafa (disaster recovery)", "rw": "Disaster recovery (gahunda yo kugarura sisitemu nyuma y'ibiza)"},
     "A plan and set of steps for getting computer systems and data working again after a serious disruption such as fire, flood, power failure, hardware loss or a cyberattack.",
     "Write down which systems matter most, how fast each must return, where backups are and who does what. Practise the plan at least once a year, because a plan that is never tested often fails when needed.",
     "Plan et ensemble d'étapes pour remettre en marche systèmes et données après une grave interruption : incendie, inondation, coupure d'électricité, perte de matériel ou cyberattaque.",
     "Notez quels systèmes comptent le plus, en combien de temps chacun doit revenir, où sont les sauvegardes et qui fait quoi. Exercez le plan au moins une fois par an : un plan jamais testé échoue souvent au moment voulu.",
     "Ni gahunda n'intambwe zo gusubiza mudasobwa n'amakuru ku murongo nyuma y'ihungabana rikomeye nk'inkongi, umwuzure, kubura umuriro, kubura ibikoresho cyangwa igitero cya interineti.",
     "Andika sisitemu z'ingenzi cyane, igihe buri imwe igomba kugarurwamo, aho kopi ziri n'uzakora iki. Itoze iyo gahunda nibura rimwe mu mwaka, kuko gahunda itigeze igeragezwa ikunze gutsindwa igihe ikenewe.",
     "Ni mpango na hatua za kurejesha mifumo ya kompyuta na data baada ya usumbufu mkubwa kama moto, mafuriko, kukatika umeme, kupoteza vifaa au shambulio la mtandao.",
     "Andika mifumo muhimu zaidi, kila mmoja unahitaji kurudi baada ya muda gani, nakala rudufu ziko wapi na nani anafanya nini. Fanya mazoezi ya mpango angalau mara moja kwa mwaka, kwani mpango usiojaribiwa mara nyingi hushindwa."),
    ("business-continuity", "Business continuity", ["business continuity", "business continuity plan", "bcp", "continuity planning", "continuité d'activité", "continuite d'activite", "plan de continuité", "mwendelezo wa biashara", "komeza imirimo"], "operations", "shop owner and customers at a market stall",
     {"fr": "Continuité d'activité", "sw": "Mwendelezo wa biashara (business continuity)", "rw": "Business continuity (gukomeza imirimo mu gihe cy'ibibazo)"},
     "Planning so that an organisation can keep delivering its most important services during and after a disruption, whether it is a cyberattack, power cut, illness of key staff or loss of a supplier.",
     "It is wider than IT recovery: it covers people, premises, suppliers and communication. Decide which services must continue, who is the backup for each key person, and how you will tell customers or students.",
     "Planification permettant à une organisation de continuer à fournir ses services essentiels pendant et après une perturbation : cyberattaque, coupure d'électricité, maladie de personnes clés ou perte d'un fournisseur.",
     "C'est plus large que la reprise informatique : personnes, locaux, fournisseurs et communication. Décidez quels services doivent continuer, qui remplace chaque personne clé et comment informer clients ou élèves.",
     "Ni igenamigambi rituma ikigo gikomeza gutanga serivisi z'ingenzi mu gihe cy'ihungabana n'ako kanya nyuma yaryo, haba ari igitero cya interineti, kubura umuriro, kurwara kw'abakozi b'ingenzi cyangwa kubura utanga ibicuruzwa.",
     "Ni binini kurusha kugarura ikoranabuhanga: bikubiyemo abantu, inyubako, abatanga ibicuruzwa n'itumanaho. Hitamo serivisi zigomba gukomeza, ugenere umusimbura wa buri muntu w'ingenzi, kandi utegure uko uzamenyesha abakiriya cyangwa abanyeshuri.",
     "Ni mipango inayowezesha shirika kuendelea kutoa huduma zake muhimu wakati na baada ya usumbufu, iwe shambulio la mtandao, kukatika umeme, ugonjwa wa wafanyakazi muhimu au kupoteza msambazaji.",
     "Ni pana kuliko urejeshaji wa TEHAMA: inahusu watu, majengo, wasambazaji na mawasiliano. Amua huduma zipi lazima ziendelee, nani anachukua nafasi ya kila mtu muhimu na utawajulishaje wateja au wanafunzi."),
    ("incident-response", "Incident response", ["incident response", "ir plan", "incident response plan", "security incident handling", "réponse aux incidents", "reponse aux incidents", "gestion des incidents", "mwitikio wa matukio ya usalama", "gusubiza ibitero"], "operations", "emergency response team at a computer",
     {"fr": "Réponse aux incidents", "sw": "Mwitikio wa matukio ya usalama (incident response)", "rw": "Incident response (gusubiza ibitero by'umutekano)"},
     "The organised way an organisation prepares for, detects, contains, removes and learns from a security incident such as a breach, malware infection or stolen device.",
     "Have a short written plan: who to call, how to isolate affected devices, who may speak to the public, and when to inform authorities or those affected. If you suspect an incident, disconnect the device, do not delete anything, and report quickly.",
     "Façon organisée dont une organisation se prépare à un incident de sécurité (fuite, infection par malware, appareil volé), le détecte, le contient, l'élimine et en tire des leçons.",
     "Ayez un court plan écrit : qui appeler, comment isoler les appareils touchés, qui peut s'exprimer publiquement, quand prévenir les autorités ou les personnes concernées. En cas de doute, déconnectez l'appareil, ne supprimez rien et signalez vite.",
     "Ni uburyo bunoze ikigo kiteguramo, kibona, gihagarika, gikuraho kandi kigiramo amasomo ku kibazo cy'umutekano nk'imenekwa ry'amakuru, kwandura malware cyangwa kwibwa igikoresho.",
     "Ugire gahunda ngufi yanditse: uwo guhamagara, uko uhagarika ibikoresho byibasiwe, ushobora kuvugana n'abantu bose, n'igihe cyo kumenyesha ubuyobozi cyangwa abahuye n'ikibazo. Niba ukeka, ukure igikoresho ku murongo, ntugusibe icyo ari cyo cyose kandi ubimenyeshe vuba.",
     "Ni njia iliyopangwa ambayo shirika hujiandaa, kugundua, kudhibiti, kuondoa na kujifunza kutokana na tukio la usalama kama uvujaji, maambukizi ya programu hasidi au kifaa kilichoibiwa.",
     "Kuwa na mpango mfupi wa maandishi: nani wa kupigia, jinsi ya kutenga vifaa vilivyoathirika, nani anaweza kuzungumza na umma na lini kuarifu mamlaka au walioathirika. Ukishuku, tenganisha kifaa, usifute chochote na ripoti haraka."),
    ("digital-forensics", "Digital forensics", ["digital forensics", "computer forensics", "cyber forensics", "forensic analysis", "forensique numérique", "investigation numérique", "criminalistique numérique", "uchunguzi wa kidijitali", "ubusesenguzi bw'ibimenyetso bya digitale"], "operations", "police forensic laboratory",
     {"fr": "Investigation numérique (forensique)", "sw": "Uchunguzi wa kidijitali (digital forensics)", "rw": "Digital forensics (gusesengura ibimenyetso byo muri mudasobwa na telefone)"},
     "The careful collection and examination of data from computers, phones and networks to find out what happened in an incident, in a way that keeps the evidence reliable enough to be used in an investigation or court.",
     "After a suspected incident, avoid switching things on and off, deleting files or reinstalling, because that can destroy clues. Call your IT team or the police and let trained investigators copy and examine the devices.",
     "Collecte et examen rigoureux de données d'ordinateurs, téléphones et réseaux pour comprendre ce qui s'est passé lors d'un incident, de façon à garder des preuves assez fiables pour une enquête ou un tribunal.",
     "Après un incident présumé, évitez d'allumer et éteindre, de supprimer des fichiers ou de réinstaller : cela peut détruire des indices. Appelez votre service informatique ou la police et laissez des enquêteurs formés copier et examiner les appareils.",
     "Ni ugukusanya no gusuzuma neza amakuru ari muri mudasobwa, telefone n'imiyoboro kugira ngo hamenyekane ibyabaye, mu buryo bugumisha ibimenyetso kwizerwa bihagije mu iperereza cyangwa mu rukiko.",
     "Nyuma y'igitero ukeka, wirinde gufungura no kuzimya ibikoresho, gusiba dosiye cyangwa kongera gushyiramo sisitemu, kuko bishobora gusenya ibimenyetso. Hamagara ikipe y'ikoranabuhanga cyangwa polisi, abashinzwe iperereza bahuguwe bakope kandi basuzume ibikoresho.",
     "Ni ukusanyaji na uchunguzi makini wa data kutoka kompyuta, simu na mitandao ili kujua kilichotokea katika tukio, kwa njia inayohifadhi ushahidi kuwa wa kuaminika kwa uchunguzi au mahakamani.",
     "Baada ya tukio unaloshuku, epuka kuwasha na kuzima, kufuta faili au kusakinisha upya, kwani kunaweza kuharibu ushahidi. Piga timu ya TEHAMA au polisi na waache wachunguzi waliofunzwa wanakili na kuchunguza vifaa."),
    ("chain-of-custody", "Chain of custody", ["chain of custody", "evidence custody", "evidence handling", "custody log", "chaîne de conservation", "chaine de conservation", "chaîne de possession", "mnyororo wa uhifadhi wa ushahidi", "urukurikirane rw'ibimenyetso"], "operations", "sealed evidence bags",
     {"fr": "Chaîne de conservation des preuves", "sw": "Chain of custody (mnyororo wa uhifadhi wa ushahidi)", "rw": "Chain of custody (urukurikirane rw'abafashe ibimenyetso)"},
     "A written record showing who held a piece of evidence, when, where and why, from the moment it was collected until it is presented, so nobody can claim it was swapped or altered.",
     "If you may need to report a crime, note the date and time, label and seal devices or copies, and write down each person who handled them. Ask police or a forensic expert how to preserve evidence properly.",
     "Registre écrit montrant qui a détenu une preuve, quand, où et pourquoi, depuis sa collecte jusqu'à sa présentation, afin que personne ne puisse prétendre qu'elle a été échangée ou modifiée.",
     "Si vous devez signaler un délit, notez la date et l'heure, étiquetez et scellez appareils ou copies, et inscrivez chaque personne qui les a manipulés. Demandez à la police ou à un expert comment conserver correctement les preuves.",
     "Ni inyandiko igaragaza uwafashe ikimenyetso, igihe, aho n'impamvu, kuva cyakusanywa kugeza gishyikirijwe, kugira ngo hatagira uvuga ko cyahinduwe cyangwa gisimbuzwa.",
     "Niba ushobora gutanga ikirego, andika itariki n'isaha, shyiraho ibirango kandi ufunge ibikoresho cyangwa kopi, wandike buri muntu wabikozeho. Baza polisi cyangwa impuguke uko wabika ibimenyetso neza.",
     "Ni kumbukumbu iliyoandikwa inayoonyesha nani alishika ushahidi, lini, wapi na kwa nini, tangu ulipokusanywa hadi kuwasilishwa, ili mtu yeyote asiseme ulibadilishwa au kuharibiwa.",
     "Ikiwa unaweza kuripoti uhalifu, andika tarehe na saa, weka lebo na ufunge vifaa au nakala, na uandike kila mtu aliyevishika. Uliza polisi au mtaalamu jinsi ya kuhifadhi ushahidi ipasavyo."),
    ("log-management", "Log management", ["log management", "logging", "security logs", "audit logs", "siem", "event logs", "gestion des journaux", "journalisation", "usimamizi wa kumbukumbu za mfumo", "kubika amakuru y'ibikorwa bya sisitemu"], "operations", "server monitoring screens",
     {"fr": "Gestion des journaux (logs)", "sw": "Usimamizi wa kumbukumbu za mfumo (log management)", "rw": "Log management (kubika no gusesengura inyandiko z'ibikorwa bya sisitemu)"},
     "Collecting, storing and reviewing the automatic records (logs) that systems keep of events such as sign-ins, errors and changes, so unusual activity can be spotted and investigated later.",
     "Keep logs of important systems for a defined period, protect them from tampering, and review failed sign-ins and odd changes. Logs may contain personal data, so restrict who can read them.",
     "Collecter, conserver et examiner les enregistrements automatiques (journaux) que les systèmes tiennent des événements comme connexions, erreurs et modifications, pour repérer puis enquêter sur des activités inhabituelles.",
     "Conservez les journaux des systèmes importants pendant une durée définie, protégez-les contre toute altération et examinez les connexions échouées et changements étranges. Ils peuvent contenir des données personnelles : limitez l'accès.",
     "Ni ugukusanya, kubika no gusuzuma inyandiko zikorwa na sisitemu ubwazo (logs) ku bikorwa nko kwinjira, amakosa n'impinduka, kugira ngo ibikorwa bidasanzwe bibonwe kandi bisuzumwe nyuma.",
     "Bika logs z'sisitemu z'ingenzi mu gihe cyagenwe, uzirinde guhindurwa, kandi usuzume kwinjira byanze n'impinduka zidasanzwe. Zishobora kuba zirimo amakuru bwite, bityo ugabanye abemerewe kuzisoma.",
     "Ni kukusanya, kuhifadhi na kukagua rekodi za kiotomatiki (logs) ambazo mifumo huweka kuhusu matukio kama kuingia, hitilafu na mabadiliko, ili shughuli zisizo za kawaida zionekane na kuchunguzwa baadaye.",
     "Hifadhi logs za mifumo muhimu kwa muda uliobainishwa, zilinde dhidi ya kuchezewa, na kagua kuingia kulikoshindwa na mabadiliko ya ajabu. Zinaweza kuwa na data binafsi, kwa hivyo punguza anayeweza kuzisoma."),
    ("security-awareness-training", "Security awareness training", ["security awareness training", "cyber awareness training", "security training", "staff training security", "awareness training", "formation à la sensibilisation", "sensibilisation à la sécurité", "mafunzo ya uelewa wa usalama", "amahugurwa ku mutekano"], "defense", "people in a training class",
     {"fr": "Formation de sensibilisation à la sécurité", "sw": "Mafunzo ya uelewa wa usalama", "rw": "Amahugurwa ku bijyanye n'umutekano (security awareness)"},
     "Teaching staff, students and members how to recognise and avoid common threats such as phishing, weak passwords and unsafe sharing, and what to do when something looks wrong.",
     "Short, regular sessions with real local examples work better than one long lecture. Practise reporting a suspicious message, make reporting easy and blame-free, and include new staff on their first week.",
     "Enseigner au personnel, aux élèves et aux membres à reconnaître et éviter les menaces courantes comme l'hameçonnage, les mots de passe faibles et le partage risqué, et quoi faire quand quelque chose semble anormal.",
     "Des séances courtes et régulières avec des exemples locaux réels valent mieux qu'un long exposé. Entraînez-vous à signaler un message suspect, rendez le signalement facile et sans reproche, et formez les nouveaux dès leur première semaine.",
     "Ni ukwigisha abakozi, abanyeshuri n'abanyamuryango kumenya no kwirinda ibyago bisanzwe nka phishing, amagambo y'ibanga adakomeye no gusangiza nabi, n'icyo bakora iyo hari ibitameze neza.",
     "Amahugurwa magufi kandi ahoraho afite ingero z'ahangaha aruta ikiganiro kirekire kimwe. Itoze gutanga ubutumwa bukemangwa, koroshya gutanga amakuru nta gucyahwa, kandi uhugure abashya mu cyumweru cya mbere.",
     "Ni kuwafundisha wafanyakazi, wanafunzi na wanachama kutambua na kuepuka vitisho vya kawaida kama ulaghai wa barua pepe, nenosiri dhaifu na kushiriki kusiko salama, na cha kufanya kitu kinapoonekana kibaya.",
     "Vikao vifupi vya mara kwa mara vyenye mifano halisi ya hapa nchini hufaa kuliko hotuba moja ndefu. Fanyeni mazoezi ya kuripoti ujumbe wa kutia shaka, fanya kuripoti kuwa rahisi bila lawama na wajumuishe wapya wiki ya kwanza."),
    ("risk-assessment", "Risk assessment", ["risk assessment", "security risk assessment", "risk analysis", "risk evaluation", "évaluation des risques", "evaluation des risques", "analyse de risques", "tathmini ya hatari", "isuzuma ry'ibyago"], "governance", "managers reviewing documents at a table",
     {"fr": "Évaluation des risques", "sw": "Tathmini ya hatari (risk assessment)", "rw": "Isuzuma ry'ibyago (risk assessment)"},
     "A structured way to identify what could go wrong, how likely it is, how much damage it would cause and what to do about it, so effort and money go first to the biggest risks.",
     "List your important data and systems, note threats and weaknesses, rate likelihood and impact, then decide to reduce, accept, transfer or avoid each risk. Repeat when your business or technology changes.",
     "Méthode structurée pour identifier ce qui pourrait mal tourner, sa probabilité, l'ampleur des dégâts et la réponse à y apporter, afin de consacrer d'abord les efforts et l'argent aux plus grands risques.",
     "Listez vos données et systèmes importants, notez menaces et faiblesses, évaluez probabilité et impact, puis décidez de réduire, accepter, transférer ou éviter chaque risque. Recommencez quand votre activité ou vos technologies changent.",
     "Ni uburyo buteguye bwo kumenya ibishobora kugenda nabi, uko bishoboka, ingano y'ibyangirika n'icyakorwa, kugira ngo imbaraga n'amafaranga bijye mbere ku byago bikomeye.",
     "Andika amakuru na sisitemu by'ingenzi, ugaragaze ibyago n'intege nke, upime uko bishoboka n'ingaruka zabyo, maze ufate icyemezo cyo kugabanya, kwemera, kwegurira abandi cyangwa kwirinda buri cyago. Subiramo iyo ubucuruzi cyangwa ikoranabuhanga bihindutse.",
     "Ni njia iliyopangwa ya kutambua kinachoweza kwenda vibaya, uwezekano wake, ukubwa wa madhara na hatua za kuchukua, ili juhudi na fedha zianze kwa hatari kubwa zaidi.",
     "Orodhesha data na mifumo muhimu, bainisha vitisho na udhaifu, kadiria uwezekano na athari, kisha amua kupunguza, kukubali, kuhamisha au kuepuka kila hatari. Rudia biashara au teknolojia inapobadilika."),
    ("threat-modeling", "Threat modeling", ["threat modeling", "threat modelling", "threat model", "stride", "modélisation des menaces", "modelisation des menaces", "uundaji wa mfano wa vitisho", "gusesengura ibyago bishobora kuba"], "appsec", "engineers sketching a plan on a whiteboard",
     {"fr": "Modélisation des menaces", "sw": "Threat modeling (kuchambua vitisho vinavyoweza kutokea)", "rw": "Threat modeling (gusesengura ibyago bishobora kubaho)"},
     "A design-stage exercise in which a team maps how a system works, who might attack it and how, and decides which protections to build in before problems appear.",
     "Ask simple questions at the start of any project: what are we protecting, who might want it, how could they reach it, and what will we do about it. Revisit when the design changes.",
     "Exercice de conception où une équipe schématise le fonctionnement d'un système, qui pourrait l'attaquer et comment, puis décide des protections à intégrer avant que les problèmes n'apparaissent.",
     "Posez des questions simples au début de tout projet : que protège-t-on, qui pourrait le vouloir, comment y accéder, et que fait-on ? Reprenez l'exercice lorsque la conception change.",
     "Ni igikorwa cyo mu gihe cyo gutegura aho itsinda rigaragaza uko sisitemu ikora, uwayitera n'uko, rigahitamo uburinzi bwo gushyiramo ibibazo bitaraboneka.",
     "Baza ibibazo byoroshye ku itangiriro ya buri umushinga: turinda iki, ni nde wakifuza, yakigeraho ate, kandi dukore iki. Subiramo iyo igishushanyo gihindutse.",
     "Ni zoezi la hatua ya usanifu ambapo timu hupanga mfumo unavyofanya kazi, nani anaweza kuushambulia na kwa njia gani, na kuamua ulinzi wa kujenga kabla matatizo hayajatokea.",
     "Uliza maswali rahisi mwanzoni mwa mradi wowote: tunalinda nini, nani anaweza kukitaka, wangekifikiaje na tutafanya nini. Rudia muundo unapobadilika."),
    ("security-audit", "Security audit", ["security audit", "it audit", "cybersecurity audit", "information security audit", "audit de sécurité", "audit de securite", "audit informatique", "ukaguzi wa usalama", "igenzura ry'umutekano"], "governance", "auditor reviewing paperwork",
     {"fr": "Audit de sécurité", "sw": "Ukaguzi wa usalama (security audit)", "rw": "Igenzura ry'umutekano (security audit)"},
     "A systematic review of an organisation's systems, policies and practices against a chosen standard, law or internal rule, to see whether protections exist and work as claimed.",
     "Audits produce a report of gaps and recommendations. Prepare by keeping policies, inventories and logs in order, and assign someone to fix each finding with a deadline. External auditors give an independent view.",
     "Examen systématique des systèmes, politiques et pratiques d'une organisation au regard d'une norme, d'une loi ou d'une règle interne, pour vérifier que les protections existent et fonctionnent comme annoncé.",
     "Un audit produit un rapport d'écarts et de recommandations. Préparez-vous en tenant en ordre politiques, inventaires et journaux, et désignez quelqu'un pour corriger chaque point avec une échéance. Un auditeur externe offre un regard indépendant.",
     "Ni isuzuma rikorwa ku buryo buhamye rya sisitemu, politiki n'imikorere y'ikigo hagereranywa n'ibipimo, itegeko cyangwa amategeko y'imbere, harebwa niba uburinzi buhari kandi bukora nk'uko bivugwa.",
     "Igenzura risohora raporo y'ibibura n'inama. Itegure ubika politiki, urutonde rw'ibikoresho na logs mu buryo buboneye, kandi ugenere umuntu wo gukosora buri kibazo afite igihe ntarengwa. Umugenzuzi wo hanze atanga ubwigenge.",
     "Ni mapitio ya utaratibu ya mifumo, sera na desturi za shirika dhidi ya kiwango, sheria au kanuni ya ndani, kuona kama ulinzi upo na unafanya kazi kama inavyodaiwa.",
     "Ukaguzi hutoa ripoti ya mapengo na mapendekezo. Jiandae kwa kuweka sera, orodha na logs sawa, na mpe mtu kurekebisha kila matokeo kwa tarehe maalum. Mkaguzi wa nje hutoa mtazamo huru."),
    ("data-classification", "Data classification", ["data classification", "information classification", "classify data", "sensitivity labels", "classification des données", "classification des donnees", "uainishaji wa data", "gutandukanya amakuru ku rwego rw'ibanga", "public confidential"], "governance", "locked cabinet and open shelves",
     {"fr": "Classification des données", "sw": "Uainishaji wa data (data classification)", "rw": "Data classification (gushyira amakuru mu byiciro ukurikije ibanga)"},
     "Sorting information into levels such as public, internal, confidential and restricted, so each level gets the right protection and handling rules.",
     "Not everything needs the same strength of protection. Decide the levels, label documents and folders, and set who may see, copy, send or store each level. Personal data and financial records usually belong in higher levels.",
     "Classer l'information en niveaux tels que public, interne, confidentiel et restreint, afin que chaque niveau reçoive la protection et les règles de traitement adaptées.",
     "Tout n'exige pas la même protection. Définissez les niveaux, étiquetez documents et dossiers, et précisez qui peut voir, copier, envoyer ou stocker chaque niveau. Données personnelles et financières relèvent en général des niveaux élevés.",
     "Ni ugushyira amakuru mu byiciro nk'aya rubanda, ay'imbere mu kigo, ay'ibanga n'ayabujijwe, kugira ngo buri cyiciro gihabwe uburinzi n'amategeko akwiye.",
     "Ibintu byose ntibikenera uburinzi bungana. Hitamo ibyiciro, shyira ibirango ku nyandiko n'ububiko, kandi ugene ushobora kubona, gukopera, kohereza cyangwa kubika buri cyiciro. Amakuru bwite n'ay'imari akenshi ajya mu byiciro byo hejuru.",
     "Ni kupanga taarifa katika ngazi kama ya umma, ya ndani, ya siri na iliyozuiliwa, ili kila ngazi ipate ulinzi na kanuni za kushughulikia zinazofaa.",
     "Si kila kitu kinahitaji ulinzi sawa. Amua ngazi, weka lebo kwenye nyaraka na folda, na ubainishe nani anaweza kuona, kunakili, kutuma au kuhifadhi kila ngazi. Data binafsi na rekodi za fedha kwa kawaida huwa ngazi za juu."),
    ("personal-data-protection", "Personal data protection (Rwanda Law No 058/2021)", ["personal data protection", "data protection", "data privacy", "rwanda data protection law", "law 058/2021", "law no 058/2021", "protection des données personnelles", "protection des donnees personnelles", "ulinzi wa data binafsi", "kurengera amakuru bwite", "amategeko arengera amakuru bwite"], "governance", "lawyer reading legal documents",
     {"fr": "Protection des données personnelles", "sw": "Ulinzi wa data binafsi", "rw": "Kurengera amakuru bwite n'ubuzima bwite"},
     "Rules and practices that protect information about identifiable people. Rwanda's Law No 058/2021 of 13/10/2021 relates to the protection of personal data and privacy and sets duties for those who handle such data.",
     "Collect only what you need, say why, keep it safe and delete it when no longer needed. This is general information, not legal advice: read the official law or ask a qualified adviser about your obligations.",
     "Règles et pratiques qui protègent les informations sur des personnes identifiables. La loi rwandaise n° 058/2021 du 13/10/2021 concerne la protection des données personnelles et de la vie privée et fixe des devoirs à ceux qui les traitent.",
     "Ne collectez que le nécessaire, expliquez pourquoi, protégez et supprimez ce qui n'est plus utile. Ce sont des informations générales, pas un avis juridique : lisez le texte officiel ou demandez conseil à un professionnel du droit.",
     "Ni amategeko n'imikorere birinda amakuru ku bantu bashobora kumenyekana. Itegeko rya Rwanda No 058/2021 ryo ku wa 13/10/2021 ryerekeye kurengera amakuru bwite n'ubuzima bwite kandi rishyiraho inshingano ku bayakoresha.",
     "Kusanya ibikenewe gusa, vuga impamvu, uyarinde kandi uyasibe iyo atagikenewe. Ibi ni ibisobanuro rusange, si inama z'amategeko: soma itegeko ryemewe cyangwa ubaze umujyanama w'amategeko uzi ibijyanye n'inshingano zawe.",
     "Ni kanuni na desturi zinazolinda taarifa za watu wanaotambulika. Sheria ya Rwanda Na. 058/2021 ya tarehe 13/10/2021 inahusu ulinzi wa data binafsi na faragha na inaweka wajibu kwa wanaoshughulikia data hiyo.",
     "Kusanya kinachohitajika tu, eleza sababu, ilinde na ifute isipohitajika tena. Hii ni taarifa ya jumla, si ushauri wa kisheria: soma sheria rasmi au muulize mshauri mwenye sifa kuhusu wajibu wako."),
    ("gdpr", "GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)", ["gdpr", "general data protection regulation", "eu data protection law", "european data protection", "rgpd", "règlement général sur la protection des données", "reglement general sur la protection des donnees", "kanuni ya ulinzi wa data ya ulaya", "itegeko ry'uburayi ryo kurengera amakuru"], "governance", "European Union flags in front of a building",
     {"fr": "RGPD (Règlement général sur la protection des données)", "sw": "GDPR (kanuni ya Umoja wa Ulaya ya ulinzi wa data)", "rw": "GDPR (itegeko ry'Umuryango w'Uburayi ryo kurengera amakuru bwite)"},
     "A European Union regulation on the protection of personal data, which gives individuals rights over their data and sets duties for organisations handling it. It can also apply to organisations outside Europe that serve people in the EU.",
     "It matters to African businesses and universities that deal with EU customers, partners or students. Read the official text or ask a qualified adviser to learn whether and how it applies to you.",
     "Règlement de l'Union européenne sur la protection des données personnelles, qui donne aux personnes des droits sur leurs données et impose des obligations aux organisations qui les traitent. Il peut aussi s'appliquer hors d'Europe à qui sert des personnes dans l'UE.",
     "Il concerne les entreprises et universités africaines qui traitent avec des clients, partenaires ou étudiants de l'UE. Lisez le texte officiel ou consultez un conseiller qualifié pour savoir s'il s'applique à vous.",
     "Ni itegeko ry'Umuryango w'Uburayi ku kurengera amakuru bwite, ritanga uburenganzira ku bantu ku makuru yabo kandi rigashyiraho inshingano ku bayakoresha. Rishobora no gukurikizwa ku bigo byo hanze y'Uburayi bifasha abantu bo muri EU.",
     "Rifitiye akamaro ubucuruzi na kaminuza byo muri Afurika bikorana n'abakiriya, abafatanyabikorwa cyangwa abanyeshuri bo muri EU. Soma inyandiko yemewe cyangwa ubaze umujyanama w'amategeko niba ribireba.",
     "Ni kanuni ya Umoja wa Ulaya kuhusu ulinzi wa data binafsi, inayowapa watu haki juu ya data yao na kuweka wajibu kwa mashirika yanayoishughulikia. Inaweza pia kutumika nje ya Ulaya kwa wanaohudumia watu wa EU.",
     "Ina umuhimu kwa biashara na vyuo vya Afrika vinavyohudumia wateja, washirika au wanafunzi wa EU. Soma maandishi rasmi au muulize mshauri mwenye sifa kama inakuhusu."),
    ("iso-27001", "ISO/IEC 27001", ["iso 27001", "iso/iec 27001", "iso27001", "isms", "information security management system", "norme iso 27001", "iso 27001 certification", "kiwango cha iso 27001", "ibipimo bya iso 27001"], "governance", "auditor with checklist in an office",
     {"fr": "ISO/IEC 27001 (norme de management de la sécurité de l'information)", "sw": "ISO/IEC 27001 (kiwango cha usimamizi wa usalama wa taarifa)", "rw": "ISO/IEC 27001 (igipimo mpuzamahanga cy'imicungire y'umutekano w'amakuru)"},
     "An international standard describing how to set up, run and keep improving an information security management system, so that an organisation manages its security risks in an organised, documented way.",
     "Organisations can be audited and certified against it, which customers and partners may ask for. Certification does not mean no incident can happen. Obtain the official standard and consult a qualified adviser before relying on it.",
     "Norme internationale qui décrit comment mettre en place, exploiter et améliorer en continu un système de management de la sécurité de l'information, afin de gérer ses risques de façon organisée et documentée.",
     "Une organisation peut être auditée et certifiée, ce que clients et partenaires peuvent exiger. La certification n'exclut pas tout incident. Procurez-vous la norme officielle et consultez un conseiller qualifié avant de vous y fier.",
     "Ni igipimo mpuzamahanga gisobanura uko washyiraho, gukoresha no guhora unoza uburyo bwo gucunga umutekano w'amakuru, kugira ngo ikigo gicunge ibyago by'umutekano mu buryo buteguye kandi bwanditswe.",
     "Ibigo bishobora kugenzurwa no guhabwa icyemezo kuri cyo, ibyo abakiriya n'abafatanyabikorwa bashobora gusaba. Icyemezo ntikivuga ko nta kibazo kizongera kubaho. Shaka igipimo cyemewe kandi ubaze umujyanama w'umwuga mbere yo kucyishingikirizaho.",
     "Ni kiwango cha kimataifa kinachoeleza jinsi ya kuanzisha, kuendesha na kuboresha mfumo wa usimamizi wa usalama wa taarifa, ili shirika lisimamie hatari za usalama kwa mpangilio na kumbukumbu.",
     "Mashirika yanaweza kukaguliwa na kuthibitishwa, jambo ambalo wateja na washirika wanaweza kuomba. Cheti hakimaanishi hakuna tukio litakalotokea. Pata kiwango rasmi na wasiliana na mshauri mwenye sifa kabla ya kukitegemea."),
    ("nist-cybersecurity-framework", "NIST Cybersecurity Framework", ["nist cybersecurity framework", "nist csf", "nist framework", "csf", "nist", "cadre de cybersécurité du nist", "cadre nist", "mfumo wa usalama wa mtandao wa nist", "nist cyber framework"], "governance", "cybersecurity professionals at workstations",
     {"fr": "Cadre de cybersécurité du NIST", "sw": "NIST Cybersecurity Framework (mfumo wa NIST wa usalama wa mtandao)", "rw": "NIST Cybersecurity Framework (umurongo ngenderwaho wa NIST mu mutekano wa interineti)"},
     "A voluntary framework published by the US standards agency NIST that helps organisations of any size organise their cybersecurity work around functions such as identify, protect, detect, respond and recover.",
     "Used worldwide as a plain checklist for planning and discussing security with managers. Newer versions also stress governance. Use the official NIST documents and an adviser to adapt it to your organisation.",
     "Cadre volontaire publié par l'agence américaine de normalisation NIST, qui aide les organisations de toute taille à structurer leur cybersécurité autour de fonctions comme identifier, protéger, détecter, répondre et rétablir.",
     "Utilisé dans le monde entier comme liste claire pour planifier et en parler avec la direction. Les versions récentes insistent aussi sur la gouvernance. Consultez les documents officiels du NIST et un conseiller pour l'adapter.",
     "Ni urwego rw'ubushake rwatanzwe n'ikigo cy'Amerika gishinzwe ibipimo NIST, rufasha ibigo bingana byose gutegura akazi k'umutekano hakurikijwe imirimo nko kumenya, kurinda, kubona, gusubiza no kugarura.",
     "Rukoreshwa hirya no hino nk'urutonde rworoshye rwo gutegura no kuganira n'abayobozi. Inyandiko nshya zishimangira no kuyobora. Koresha inyandiko zemewe za NIST n'umujyanama kugira ngo uruhuze n'ikigo cyawe.",
     "Ni mfumo wa hiari uliochapishwa na wakala wa viwango wa Marekani NIST, unaosaidia mashirika ya ukubwa wowote kupanga kazi ya usalama kulingana na kazi kama kutambua, kulinda, kugundua, kukabili na kurejesha.",
     "Hutumika duniani kote kama orodha rahisi ya kupanga na kujadiliana na mameneja. Matoleo mapya pia yanasisitiza uongozi. Tumia nyaraka rasmi za NIST na mshauri ili kuurekebisha kwa shirika lako."),
    ("pci-dss", "PCI DSS", ["pci dss", "pci-dss", "pci", "payment card industry data security standard", "card data standard", "norme pci dss", "norme de sécurité des cartes de paiement", "kiwango cha usalama wa kadi za malipo", "igipimo cy'umutekano w'amakarita yo kwishyura"], "governance", "payment card on a point of sale terminal",
     {"fr": "PCI DSS (norme de sécurité des données des cartes de paiement)", "sw": "PCI DSS (kiwango cha usalama wa data ya kadi za malipo)", "rw": "PCI DSS (igipimo cy'umutekano w'amakuru y'amakarita yo kwishyura)"},
     "A security standard created by the payment card industry for organisations that store, process or transmit card payment data, setting requirements such as secure networks, access control and monitoring.",
     "Shops, hotels and websites that accept cards are usually asked by their bank or payment provider to comply. Reduce risk by using a trusted payment provider and never storing full card details; ask your provider what applies to you.",
     "Norme de sécurité créée par le secteur des cartes de paiement pour les organisations qui stockent, traitent ou transmettent des données de cartes, avec des exigences comme réseaux sécurisés, contrôle d'accès et surveillance.",
     "Commerces, hôtels et sites acceptant les cartes sont en général invités par leur banque ou prestataire à s'y conformer. Réduisez le risque avec un prestataire de paiement fiable et ne stockez jamais les données complètes de carte.",
     "Ni igipimo cy'umutekano cyakozwe n'urwego rw'amakarita yo kwishyura ku bigo bibika, bitunganya cyangwa byohereza amakuru y'amakarita, gisaba imiyoboro itekanye, kugenzura uburenganzira no gukurikirana.",
     "Amaduka, amahoteli n'imbuga zakira amakarita akenshi basabwa na banki cyangwa utanga serivisi yo kwishyura kubahiriza iki gipimo. Kugabanya ibyago, koresha utanga serivisi wizewe kandi ntukabike amakuru yose y'ikarita; baza utanga serivisi icyo kikureba.",
     "Ni kiwango cha usalama kilichotengenezwa na sekta ya kadi za malipo kwa mashirika yanayohifadhi, kuchakata au kusambaza data ya kadi, kinachoweka mahitaji kama mitandao salama, udhibiti wa ufikiaji na ufuatiliaji.",
     "Maduka, hoteli na tovuti zinazopokea kadi mara nyingi huombwa na benki au mtoa huduma wa malipo kukizingatia. Punguza hatari kwa kutumia mtoa huduma wa malipo anayeaminika na kutohifadhi data kamili ya kadi."),
    ("cyber-insurance", "Cyber insurance", ["cyber insurance", "cyber liability insurance", "cyber risk insurance", "cybersecurity insurance", "assurance cyber", "cyberassurance", "assurance cybersécurité", "bima ya mtandao", "ubwishingizi bw'ibyago bya interineti"], "governance", "insurance agent meeting a client",
     {"fr": "Cyberassurance", "sw": "Bima ya mtandao (cyber insurance)", "rw": "Ubwishingizi bw'ibyago bya interineti (cyber insurance)"},
     "An insurance product that may help cover some costs after a cyber incident, such as investigation, recovery, legal costs or customer notification. Coverage, limits and exclusions vary widely between policies.",
     "It is not a substitute for security: insurers often ask for basics like backups and two-step verification before offering cover. Read the policy carefully and ask a licensed adviser what is and is not covered.",
     "Produit d'assurance pouvant aider à couvrir certains coûts après un incident informatique : enquête, remise en état, frais juridiques ou information des clients. Garanties, plafonds et exclusions varient beaucoup selon les contrats.",
     "Elle ne remplace pas la sécurité : les assureurs demandent souvent des bases comme sauvegardes et vérification en deux étapes avant de couvrir. Lisez bien le contrat et demandez à un conseiller agréé ce qui est couvert ou non.",
     "Ni ubwishingizi bushobora gufasha kwishyura bimwe mu biciro nyuma y'ikibazo cya interineti, nk'iperereza, kugarura, amafaranga y'amategeko cyangwa kumenyesha abakiriya. Ibyishyurwa, imipaka n'ibitishyurwa biratandukanye cyane hagati y'amasezerano.",
     "Ntibusimbura umutekano: ababwishingiza bakunze gusaba ibanze nka kopi n'ukwemeza mu byiciro bibiri mbere yo gutanga ubwishingizi. Soma amasezerano witonze kandi ubaze umujyanama ufite uruhushya icyishyurwa n'icyo kitishyurwa.",
     "Ni bidhaa ya bima inayoweza kusaidia kugharamia baadhi ya gharama baada ya tukio la mtandao, kama uchunguzi, urejeshaji, gharama za kisheria au kuwajulisha wateja. Kinachofidiwa, viwango na vikwazo hutofautiana sana.",
     "Si mbadala wa usalama: bima mara nyingi huomba misingi kama nakala rudufu na uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili kabla ya kutoa bima. Soma sera kwa makini na muulize mshauri mwenye leseni kinachofidiwa na kisichofidiwa."),
    ("cyber-hygiene", "Cyber hygiene", ["cyber hygiene", "cybersecurity hygiene", "digital hygiene", "basic security habits", "online hygiene", "hygiène numérique", "hygiene numerique", "hygiène informatique", "usafi wa kidijitali", "isuku y'ikoranabuhanga"], "defense", "laptop and smartphone",
     {"fr": "Hygiène numérique", "sw": "Usafi wa kidijitali (cyber hygiene)", "rw": "Isuku y'umutekano w'ikoranabuhanga (cyber hygiene)"},
     "The set of simple, regular habits that keep devices and accounts healthy and safe, much like personal hygiene keeps the body healthy: updates, strong passwords, backups and careful clicking.",
     "Update software, use a different strong password for each account with a password manager, turn on two-step verification, back up important files, and think before opening links or attachments. Do these routinely, not once.",
     "Ensemble d'habitudes simples et régulières qui gardent appareils et comptes en bonne santé, comme l'hygiène personnelle protège le corps : mises à jour, mots de passe solides, sauvegardes et clics réfléchis.",
     "Mettez à jour vos logiciels, utilisez un mot de passe solide différent par compte avec un gestionnaire, activez la vérification en deux étapes, sauvegardez vos fichiers importants et réfléchissez avant d'ouvrir liens ou pièces jointes. Faites-le régulièrement.",
     "Ni imigenzo yoroshye kandi ihoraho ituma ibikoresho na konti bikomeza kuba bizima kandi bitekanye, nk'uko isuku y'umubiri irinda umubiri: kuvugurura, amagambo y'ibanga akomeye, kubika kopi no gukanda witonze.",
     "Vugurura porogaramu, koresha ijambo ry'ibanga rikomeye ritandukanye kuri buri konti ukoresheje porogaramu ibika amagambo y'ibanga, shyiraho kwemeza mu byiciro bibiri, bika kopi y'amadosiye y'ingenzi kandi utekereze mbere yo gukanda amaliki cyangwa gufungura ibyoherejwe. Bikore buri gihe, si rimwe gusa.",
     "Ni mazoea rahisi na ya mara kwa mara yanayoweka vifaa na akaunti katika hali nzuri na salama, kama usafi wa mwili unavyolinda mwili: masasisho, nenosiri imara, nakala rudufu na kubofya kwa makini.",
     "Sasisha programu, tumia nenosiri imara tofauti kwa kila akaunti kwa kidhibiti cha nenosiri, washa uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili, hifadhi nakala ya faili muhimu na fikiria kabla ya kufungua viungo au viambatisho. Fanya hivi mara kwa mara."),
]
